(5789417, 840458, 47852, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought it was a sweet shot with a cute kid... nice family time together.  The more I explore the photo though, I get confused.  Why desaturate the surroundings, why is there a cornstalk between her feet, why is she wearing a fancy dress and no shoes, while the two guys are in relaxed attire with sneakers? And the line going down the woman''s back and to her legs just looks horribly uncomfortable.  It almost looks like the two guys are just relaxed and having fun, and she was stuck in the photo in a specifically posed manner.  The kid IS adorable though, and I keep getting brought back to his cute little face, so maybe just a tighter crop would have helped here... at least for me.</td>', 'At first glance, I thought it was a sweet shot with a cute kid... nice family time together.  The more I explore the photo though, I get confused.  Why desaturate the surroundings, why is there a cornstalk between her feet, why is she wearing a fancy dress and no shoes, while the two guys are in relaxed attire with sneakers? And the line going down the woman''s back and to her legs just looks horribly uncomfortable.  It almost looks like the two guys are just relaxed and having fun, and she was stuck in the photo in a specifically posed manner.  The kid IS adorable though, and I keep getting brought back to his cute little face, so maybe just a tighter crop would have helped here... at least for me.', '2010-01-01 07:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
