(5789651, 841729, 15711, '<td valign="top">I loved this from the get-go.  Great tones and I like the rich shadow ones.  Nice perspective and composition. The ship dominates the shot, yet the shoreline buildings and perpendicular ship adds a nice bit of balance.</td>', 'I loved this from the get-go.  Great tones and I like the rich shadow ones.  Nice perspective and composition. The ship dominates the shot, yet the shoreline buildings and perpendicular ship adds a nice bit of balance.', '2010-01-01 10:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
