(5789654, 839478, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the delicateness and intricate detail.  Beautiful.  This would be so pretty just by itself blown up HUGE.</td>', 'I love the delicateness and intricate detail.  Beautiful.  This would be so pretty just by itself blown up HUGE.', '2010-01-01 10:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
