(5789661, 843166, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such a well done portrait.  I hate it when the pose seems forced and this is so natural.  The lighting is wonderful.  Terrific focus too.  She has incredible eyes.  Sometimes red lipstick is too much but it''s perfect here and compliments the eye color and her beautiful auburn hair.  Good luck and Happy New Year. 8</td>', 'Such a well done portrait.  I hate it when the pose seems forced and this is so natural.  The lighting is wonderful.  Terrific focus too.  She has incredible eyes.  Sometimes red lipstick is too much but it''s perfect here and compliments the eye color and her beautiful auburn hair.  Good luck and Happy New Year. 8', '2010-01-01 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5789663, 841599, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the brown leaves and gray background and then the POP of the cardinal.  The diagonal of the falling snow is wonderful.</td>', 'I love the brown leaves and gray background and then the POP of the cardinal.  The diagonal of the falling snow is wonderful.', '2010-01-01 10:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
