(5789953, 842818, 86218, '<td valign="top">Super sharp and love teh colours here. Im not to sure about the legs/feet cut off and the wing tips. Still beautifull. 7</td>', 'Super sharp and love teh colours here. Im not to sure about the legs/feet cut off and the wing tips. Still beautifull. 7', '2010-01-01 14:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5789954, 842922, 56579, '<td valign="top">With this style, and the high contrast between the dense branches and snow, make the photo hard to focus on.  The growth almost looks like noise at this size.  I am sure this photo looks great in full size, but scaled for DPC it loses a lot of the qualities I would have liked about it.</td>', 'With this style, and the high contrast between the dense branches and snow, make the photo hard to focus on.  The growth almost looks like noise at this size.  I am sure this photo looks great in full size, but scaled for DPC it loses a lot of the qualities I would have liked about it.', '2010-01-01 14:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5789955, 843092, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose and comp. Works fro me 7</td>', 'Lovely pose and comp. Works fro me 7', '2010-01-01 14:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5789957, 838946, 86218, '<td valign="top">Really special shot and like the idea. So simple and yet it evokes so much emotions. 7. I might have to come back and review this. The more I look the more I like it.</td>', 'Really special shot and like the idea. So simple and yet it evokes so much emotions. 7. I might have to come back and review this. The more I look the more I like it.', '2010-01-01 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
