(5790058, 842601, 34659, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning...  The power, the emotion, the colors, the setting, the composition - all absolutely top notch.  10 and new favorite.  Outstanding work.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning...  The power, the emotion, the colors, the setting, the composition - all absolutely top notch.  10 and new favorite.  Outstanding work.', '2010-01-01 15:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790060, 841444, 34659, '<td valign="top">This shot is incredible...  The crop is perfect.  The emotion in her eyes is overwhelming.  I think I recognize this little girl (and therefore her photographer, but I''m not 100% sure).  Regardless, this is one stunning image.  I fully expect to see this on the front page when voting is done.  Beautiful work.</td>', 'This shot is incredible...  The crop is perfect.  The emotion in her eyes is overwhelming.  I think I recognize this little girl (and therefore her photographer, but I''m not 100% sure).  Regardless, this is one stunning image.  I fully expect to see this on the front page when voting is done.  Beautiful work.', '2010-01-01 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790064, 841707, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love, love, love this!!!  Great motion and composition.  Beautiful colors, makeup and emotion.  Very well done!  I''ll bet this is from one of our masters...</td>', 'Love, love, love this!!!  Great motion and composition.  Beautiful colors, makeup and emotion.  Very well done!  I''ll bet this is from one of our masters...', '2010-01-01 15:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790067, 842940, 34659, '<td valign="top">Not sure what about this image attracts me so strongly, but something does.  I think it may be the structure of the foremost rocks.  I can see a dinosaur or a bird or some other creature looking up to the right in its formation.  The colors and composition are beautiful.  Well done.</td>', 'Not sure what about this image attracts me so strongly, but something does.  I think it may be the structure of the foremost rocks.  I can see a dinosaur or a bird or some other creature looking up to the right in its formation.  The colors and composition are beautiful.  Well done.', '2010-01-01 15:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790069, 842946, 34659, '<td valign="top">They don''t get much better than this...  Absolutely amazing photo.  The depth, breadth, and overwhelming emotion this scene evokes are all incredible.  Can''t wait to find out what your shutter speed was (and all of the processing &amp; other technical data).  Stunning shot.</td>', 'They don''t get much better than this...  Absolutely amazing photo.  The depth, breadth, and overwhelming emotion this scene evokes are all incredible.  Can''t wait to find out what your shutter speed was (and all of the processing & other technical data).  Stunning shot.', '2010-01-01 15:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790072, 842996, 34659, '<td valign="top">One of the most amazing spider shots I''ve ever seen.  Fantastic crop/composition and use of subtle hues.  Incredible capture.</td>', 'One of the most amazing spider shots I''ve ever seen.  Fantastic crop/composition and use of subtle hues.  Incredible capture.', '2010-01-01 15:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790074, 838946, 34659, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  Literally perfect.  Simple, elegant, and effective.  The intensity of the color against the white is tremendous.  Beautiful detail and DOF.</td>', 'Perfect.  Literally perfect.  Simple, elegant, and effective.  The intensity of the color against the white is tremendous.  Beautiful detail and DOF.', '2010-01-01 15:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790087, 841514, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the intentional soft focus/OOF of the entire picture.  Yet it has enough definition to "figure out" the scene.  If you''ve been on DPC for a while, this might not go over too well with the masses; I think voters will either love it or hate it.  Great risky entry, it''s one of those very under rated images.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'I like the intentional soft focus/OOF of the entire picture.  Yet it has enough definition to "figure out" the scene.  If you''ve been on DPC for a while, this might not go over too well with the masses; I think voters will either love it or hate it.  Great risky entry, it''s one of those very under rated images.  Good luck on the voting.', '2010-01-01 15:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
