(5790205, 841880, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a very interesting image with an excellent silhouette that has a story to tell. Although the black and white works, I do wonder how the colour image might look.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The portrait crop offers some environmental context to the image but I think a near landscape crop, just showing that storey would have been a bit more powerful. The near voyeuristic quality of this image is possibly a double-edged sword; I think it adds story - so may find it a little creepy.<br/> <br/>Overall: An interesting image which is effective but it may not make too many friends of the voters.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: This is a very interesting image with an excellent silhouette that has a story to tell. Although the black and white works, I do wonder how the colour image might look. Critical stuff: The portrait crop offers some environmental context to the image but I think a near landscape crop, just showing that storey would have been a bit more powerful. The near voyeuristic quality of this image is possibly a double-edged sword; I think it adds story - so may find it a little creepy. Overall: An interesting image which is effective but it may not make too many friends of the voters.', '2010-01-01 17:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790208, 843002, 63267, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the processing in this photo are great. However, I don''t like the composition.  the overhead power lines are a distraction, as are the lights from the industrial building on the left. I think a better composition on this would really transform this picture into something awesome. 6</td>', 'The lighting and the processing in this photo are great. However, I don''t like the composition.  the overhead power lines are a distraction, as are the lights from the industrial building on the left. I think a better composition on this would really transform this picture into something awesome. 6', '2010-01-01 17:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790211, 842940, 63267, '<td valign="top">This is really great.  I love the details and textures in the rocks, as well as the contrast between the warm orange hues of the rocks and the cool blue sky and water.  8</td>', 'This is really great.  I love the details and textures in the rocks, as well as the contrast between the warm orange hues of the rocks and the cool blue sky and water.  8', '2010-01-01 17:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790212, 837979, 63267, '<td valign="top">The hot spot on the center of the head of a bit distracting.  It also looks like you tried a centered composition but didn''t quite get there. Nice detail and very good magnification, but the hot spot lets it down. 6</td>', 'The hot spot on the center of the head of a bit distracting.  It also looks like you tried a centered composition but didn''t quite get there. Nice detail and very good magnification, but the hot spot lets it down. 6', '2010-01-01 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
