(5790217, 840502, 63267, '<td valign="top">The detail in the snow is great in some places and nonexistent in others. This all has a nice soft feel to it. 6</td>', 'The detail in the snow is great in some places and nonexistent in others. This all has a nice soft feel to it. 6', '2010-01-01 17:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5790220, 843115, 63267, '<td valign="top">I like the leading lines, but when I view this photo they don''t lead me down the photo as you might want. Instead, I am focused on the distant tower off to the left, and to the first post on the left.  I have to physically force my eyes to travel down the bridge with the leading lines and I don''t think that was the intention. 6</td>', 'I like the leading lines, but when I view this photo they don''t lead me down the photo as you might want. Instead, I am focused on the distant tower off to the left, and to the first post on the left.  I have to physically force my eyes to travel down the bridge with the leading lines and I don''t think that was the intention. 6', '2010-01-01 17:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
