(5790956, 842736, 86218, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning picture If I was one of three voters...I could say 100% Ribbon. It really is a special shot with powerfull mood with both beauty and hope on the right and dark and gloom on the left. Eish...I love this. 9</td>', 'This is a stunning picture If I was one of three voters...I could say 100% Ribbon. It really is a special shot with powerfull mood with both beauty and hope on the right and dark and gloom on the left. Eish...I love this. 9', '2010-01-02 07:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
