(5790963, 842838, 37529, '<td valign="top">Very emotive shot.  I really like the way this photo was done.  The blur and noise with the contrasting colors in the background works nicely.  This is a little out of the box so it may have trouble in the voting but it is an excellent shot none the less.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very emotive shot.  I really like the way this photo was done.  The blur and noise with the contrasting colors in the background works nicely.  This is a little out of the box so it may have trouble in the voting but it is an excellent shot none the less.  Good luck.', '2010-01-02 07:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
