(5791261, 843177, 86219, '<td valign="top">Pictures of ducks are frequently boring.  This one has action and color.  I like it!  I think the frame detracts a lot from the picture.  It''s too wide and the white inner frame keeps pulling my eye out of the picture to the frame.  I think a narrower, simpler border would have been more effective.</td>', 'Pictures of ducks are frequently boring.  This one has action and color.  I like it!  I think the frame detracts a lot from the picture.  It''s too wide and the white inner frame keeps pulling my eye out of the picture to the frame.  I think a narrower, simpler border would have been more effective.', '2010-01-02 11:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
