(5791465, 842996, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic capture/creation/find.  I really enjoy the dramatic appeal of the macro.  The only fault I see is how the viewers left image goes into near colourlessness.  It feels distracting to the image whole.</td>', 'This is a fantastic capture/creation/find.  I really enjoy the dramatic appeal of the macro.  The only fault I see is how the viewers left image goes into near colourlessness.  It feels distracting to the image whole.', '2010-01-02 15:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791469, 842995, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the movement of colour here.  From the bright blown-out sun to the near darkness at the edge contrasted against the viewer side shadows.  The clouds and jet-stream add a nice element of drama to the image.</td>', 'I enjoy the movement of colour here.  From the bright blown-out sun to the near darkness at the edge contrasted against the viewer side shadows.  The clouds and jet-stream add a nice element of drama to the image.', '2010-01-02 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791470, 840218, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this perspective.  The clarity and colours are wonderful and it creates a sense of element within the image.</td>', 'I enjoy this perspective.  The clarity and colours are wonderful and it creates a sense of element within the image.', '2010-01-02 15:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791471, 840298, 16197, '<td valign="top">This I feel is one of the better portraits in the challenge.  The clarity of the model as well as the light balance is well done.  However the dramatic addition of the coloured paint is a wonderful element which draws stronger interest.</td>', 'This I feel is one of the better portraits in the challenge.  The clarity of the model as well as the light balance is well done.  However the dramatic addition of the coloured paint is a wonderful element which draws stronger interest.', '2010-01-02 15:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791473, 843211, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this image.  The center comp is a bit distracting but the artistic idea and creativity is well noted.  With the yellow/green/orange of the tree against the colourless mist is nicely eyed.</td>', 'I enjoy this image.  The center comp is a bit distracting but the artistic idea and creativity is well noted.  With the yellow/green/orange of the tree against the colourless mist is nicely eyed.', '2010-01-02 15:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791475, 841432, 16197, '<td valign="top">One of the better portrait type images in the challenge.  The dramatic feel of the bright purple/black the model is wearing along with the snowfall ad a nice element to the image.  It also creates a nice contrast in front of the dull gray/muted tomb.</td>', 'One of the better portrait type images in the challenge.  The dramatic feel of the bright purple/black the model is wearing along with the snowfall ad a nice element to the image.  It also creates a nice contrast in front of the dull gray/muted tomb.', '2010-01-02 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791476, 840383, 16197, '<td valign="top">What really catches me here is nearly everything.  The colour of the churning water to the clarity of ice on the tower.  Though for me personally I would liked to have seen the frame move to the viewer left a bit.  The drop of interest on the catwalk distracts my eye.  If the frame was moved it would add more interest with the rolling water  also it would allow the tower to be moved into the 1/3 position.</td>', 'What really catches me here is nearly everything.  The colour of the churning water to the clarity of ice on the tower.  Though for me personally I would liked to have seen the frame move to the viewer left a bit.  The drop of interest on the catwalk distracts my eye.  If the frame was moved it would add more interest with the rolling water  also it would allow the tower to be moved into the 1/3 position.', '2010-01-02 15:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791485, 842937, 16197, '<td valign="top">I have seen similar images, it has a nice perspective.  Though the added drama in the sky allows for the viewer to be captured by the image moreso then otherwise.</td>', 'I have seen similar images, it has a nice perspective.  Though the added drama in the sky allows for the viewer to be captured by the image moreso then otherwise.', '2010-01-02 15:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791488, 842193, 16197, '<td valign="top">This image is nicely contrasted in my opinion.  The candidity of this image also adds a nice simple element against the sharp lines of the buildings.</td>', 'This image is nicely contrasted in my opinion.  The candidity of this image also adds a nice simple element against the sharp lines of the buildings.', '2010-01-02 15:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791490, 841567, 16197, '<td valign="top">even with the noise I find this to be one of the better portraits.  The muted colours work extremely well and often times we have seen similar activity.</td>', 'even with the noise I find this to be one of the better portraits.  The muted colours work extremely well and often times we have seen similar activity.', '2010-01-02 15:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791491, 838352, 16197, '<td valign="top">Classic image.  Well done with bright colours and clarity.</td>', 'Classic image.  Well done with bright colours and clarity.', '2010-01-02 15:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791496, 841701, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the old feeling of this image.  Brings me back to the classic movies and serials.  The dark starkness of the walls and cloths are balanced against the lightness of his face and smoke well along with the bright entrance sign really make this an interesting image.</td>', 'I really enjoy the old feeling of this image.  Brings me back to the classic movies and serials.  The dark starkness of the walls and cloths are balanced against the lightness of his face and smoke well along with the bright entrance sign really make this an interesting image.', '2010-01-02 15:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791498, 842946, 16197, '<td valign="top">I think what draws me so much to this image is not the lighting, but the clarity of stone along with the colour of the dramatic landscape with the hovering clouds far above.</td>', 'I think what draws me so much to this image is not the lighting, but the clarity of stone along with the colour of the dramatic landscape with the hovering clouds far above.', '2010-01-02 15:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791501, 840178, 16197, '<td valign="top">I scored this a bit higher because of the element of difficulty to capture something like this.  I am wondering what it would look like though if it was black/white with the contrast pushed a bit.  It make create a nice dramatic feel, or it make look like snot. Just wondering.  Overall, nice capture.</td>', 'I scored this a bit higher because of the element of difficulty to capture something like this.  I am wondering what it would look like though if it was black/white with the contrast pushed a bit.  It make create a nice dramatic feel, or it make look like snot. Just wondering.  Overall, nice capture.', '2010-01-02 15:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791506, 842917, 16197, '<td valign="top">I find this an incredibly interesting image.  Not for the content, but for the style.  I look at this and I believe it could be a miniature model.  The way the elements sit against one another appear manufactured from original and not the original.  Overall nicely captured, the colours and clarity are fantastic.</td>', 'I find this an incredibly interesting image.  Not for the content, but for the style.  I look at this and I believe it could be a miniature model.  The way the elements sit against one another appear manufactured from original and not the original.  Overall nicely captured, the colours and clarity are fantastic.', '2010-01-02 15:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791508, 838639, 16197, '<td valign="top">I am sure many people will score this lower.  Though I scored it higher.  The clarity of the window steam/moisture is there.  The colours could pop a bit more but there is really something familiar about this.  Many days I suppose in Washington State I looked at the rain outside my window.</td>', 'I am sure many people will score this lower.  Though I scored it higher.  The clarity of the window steam/moisture is there.  The colours could pop a bit more but there is really something familiar about this.  Many days I suppose in Washington State I looked at the rain outside my window.', '2010-01-02 15:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791512, 842208, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly nice image.  I believe the colours within the center piece is really what allows this image to create interest.  It appears canted to the side a bit, perhaps a more balanced/level composition would allow this piece higher scoring, but I still gave above average.</td>', 'This is a fairly nice image.  I believe the colours within the center piece is really what allows this image to create interest.  It appears canted to the side a bit, perhaps a more balanced/level composition would allow this piece higher scoring, but I still gave above average.', '2010-01-02 15:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791520, 840048, 16197, '<td valign="top">I normally would not score this style of image higher then average.  The ''dreamy'' blurred items of the docks and land create a huge distraction for me.  However this image did get higher then average because of the dramatic appeal of the sky and colours as well as the horizon line and water reflection.</td>', 'I normally would not score this style of image higher then average.  The ''dreamy'' blurred items of the docks and land create a huge distraction for me.  However this image did get higher then average because of the dramatic appeal of the sky and colours as well as the horizon line and water reflection.', '2010-01-02 15:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791522, 841748, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very interesting style of editing you used.  The emphasis of the hairs adds an element for me which leaves me on the fence.  It makes it appear drawn or created rather then captured.  Though still I scored higher because of the closeness and clarity of the image with well balanced colour.</td>', 'Very interesting style of editing you used.  The emphasis of the hairs adds an element for me which leaves me on the fence.  It makes it appear drawn or created rather then captured.  Though still I scored higher because of the closeness and clarity of the image with well balanced colour.', '2010-01-02 15:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791524, 841855, 96631, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition</td>', 'Wonderful composition', '2010-01-02 15:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791525, 842704, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fun little macro.  The colours are great and the water is fun.  Though there is the smokey feel on his head/body which distracts me a bit.</td>', 'This is a fun little macro.  The colours are great and the water is fun.  Though there is the smokey feel on his head/body which distracts me a bit.', '2010-01-02 15:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791530, 843312, 96631, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an awesome shot!  It''s scenes like this that make me stop everything and reflect.  Great work!</td>', 'Wow, this is an awesome shot!  It''s scenes like this that make me stop everything and reflect.  Great work!', '2010-01-02 15:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791532, 839478, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fantastic find/creation.  Though having seen many of these before it did not draw as much interest as it may to someone else.  Still scoring above average for the clarity and detail of the piece.</td>', 'Fantastic find/creation.  Though having seen many of these before it did not draw as much interest as it may to someone else.  Still scoring above average for the clarity and detail of the piece.', '2010-01-02 15:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791533, 841793, 16197, '<td valign="top">One of the more enjoyable straight portraits of the challenge.  The contrast of the models skin against her eyes, hat and jacket add a nice element to the neutral background.</td>', 'One of the more enjoyable straight portraits of the challenge.  The contrast of the models skin against her eyes, hat and jacket add a nice element to the neutral background.', '2010-01-02 15:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791534, 843350, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the added depth of character here as well as the muted colours.  It really creates a strong sense of personality to the portrait.</td>', 'I enjoy the added depth of character here as well as the muted colours.  It really creates a strong sense of personality to the portrait.', '2010-01-02 15:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791537, 837979, 16197, '<td valign="top">I would guess this little fella has seen the end of days.  The sharp hot-spot center head is distracting but otherwise it is a nice simple delicate macro.</td>', 'I would guess this little fella has seen the end of days.  The sharp hot-spot center head is distracting but otherwise it is a nice simple delicate macro.', '2010-01-02 15:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791538, 843083, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the clarity of the critter as well as the smoothness of it''s meal.  It contrasts nicely against the background while still connecting with it.  Though with the focal range as such it appears not real.  Still nicely captured.</td>', 'I enjoy the clarity of the critter as well as the smoothness of it''s meal.  It contrasts nicely against the background while still connecting with it.  Though with the focal range as such it appears not real.  Still nicely captured.', '2010-01-02 15:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791539, 842901, 16197, '<td valign="top">I wish for this image to not have so much smoothness as well as white space.  A closer tighter crop with more clarity of the feathers and dramatic appeal the natural texture would give.</td>', 'I wish for this image to not have so much smoothness as well as white space.  A closer tighter crop with more clarity of the feathers and dramatic appeal the natural texture would give.', '2010-01-02 15:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791540, 843137, 16197, '<td valign="top">I scored this higher then some of the other straight portraits.  I feel there is something extra with this image the others didn''t have.  Sure it has fantastic clarity and lighting.  The muted colours work well here.  But perhaps the models personification of character through the lens makes this piece stand apart from the others.</td>', 'I scored this higher then some of the other straight portraits.  I feel there is something extra with this image the others didn''t have.  Sure it has fantastic clarity and lighting.  The muted colours work well here.  But perhaps the models personification of character through the lens makes this piece stand apart from the others.', '2010-01-02 15:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791541, 843177, 16197, '<td valign="top">Not a huge duck fan but I do enjoy the drama and motion within this image.  I hoped for a bit more balance between the ducks and background or I should say less balance, more contrast to separate them more.</td>', 'Not a huge duck fan but I do enjoy the drama and motion within this image.  I hoped for a bit more balance between the ducks and background or I should say less balance, more contrast to separate them more.', '2010-01-02 15:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791543, 842197, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this piece. The feathers have nice clarity and line.  The added fun of seeing the fish is priceless.</td>', 'I enjoy this piece. The feathers have nice clarity and line.  The added fun of seeing the fish is priceless.', '2010-01-02 15:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791544, 843011, 103759, '<td valign="top">Nice...like the border as well...</td>', 'Nice...like the border as well...', '2010-01-02 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791546, 839726, 16197, '<td valign="top">One of my higher scored portraits.  When I look at this the models face does appear doll-like.  However the drama created by the hair and the side styled framing add interest for e.  The clarity and lighting and contrast works nicely for me as well.</td>', 'One of my higher scored portraits.  When I look at this the models face does appear doll-like.  However the drama created by the hair and the side styled framing add interest for e.  The clarity and lighting and contrast works nicely for me as well.', '2010-01-02 15:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791548, 843221, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The colours are enjoyable and the simple wasted elements of this side creates a nice contrast from the ''richer'' side.  The tree also adds a strong element of visual appeal.</td>', 'Interesting image.  The colours are enjoyable and the simple wasted elements of this side creates a nice contrast from the ''richer'' side.  The tree also adds a strong element of visual appeal.', '2010-01-02 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791549, 842846, 103759, '<td valign="top">Beautiful....</td>', 'Beautiful....', '2010-01-02 15:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791550, 843202, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the silhouetted tree and roof except for that ball.  However the colours of the sky and the drama of the clouds are nice appeal.</td>', 'I enjoy the silhouetted tree and roof except for that ball.  However the colours of the sky and the drama of the clouds are nice appeal.', '2010-01-02 15:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791551, 841599, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture.  Though the bird appears to have some colour noise which causes a bit of distraction and does not seem as clear as it could be.  Otherwise though this is a very nice capture and find.</td>', 'This is a nice capture.  Though the bird appears to have some colour noise which causes a bit of distraction and does not seem as clear as it could be.  Otherwise though this is a very nice capture and find.', '2010-01-02 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791553, 843011, 16197, '<td valign="top">This could be an illustration of a suspense novel.  The style appears to be created more then photographed.  It creates an interesting element of curiosity however.</td>', 'This could be an illustration of a suspense novel.  The style appears to be created more then photographed.  It creates an interesting element of curiosity however.', '2010-01-02 15:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791554, 842319, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting piece though for me it appears as if it is falling over backward.  I would have enjoyed a stronger structure line that solidifies the building while the rest angle.</td>', 'This is an interesting piece though for me it appears as if it is falling over backward.  I would have enjoyed a stronger structure line that solidifies the building while the rest angle.', '2010-01-02 15:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791555, 841671, 16197, '<td valign="top">The clarity and colour of this piece is nice.  The dramatic appeal is only slight however.  Still well captured.</td>', 'The clarity and colour of this piece is nice.  The dramatic appeal is only slight however.  Still well captured.', '2010-01-02 15:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791556, 843166, 106457, '<td valign="top">Eyes are too over-sharpened for my taste as well as the hair.</td>', 'Eyes are too over-sharpened for my taste as well as the hair.', '2010-01-02 15:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791562, 843101, 16197, '<td valign="top">Such fun laughter on the handlers face.  Though the ''pointer'' is the star of this image.  nice clarity and capture.  The colours also work well.</td>', 'Such fun laughter on the handlers face.  Though the ''pointer'' is the star of this image.  nice clarity and capture.  The colours also work well.', '2010-01-02 16:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791565, 842244, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice balance within the image.  The colours could be richer though the drama of the water is nice as is the silhouette of the pier.</td>', 'Nice balance within the image.  The colours could be richer though the drama of the water is nice as is the silhouette of the pier.', '2010-01-02 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791567, 843224, 16197, '<td valign="top">Even with the light spots on the pier, there is a nice fun element of colour and depth.  It is not fantastic, but it is nice.</td>', 'Even with the light spots on the pier, there is a nice fun element of colour and depth.  It is not fantastic, but it is nice.', '2010-01-02 16:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791568, 842207, 16197, '<td valign="top">A classic style of image.  Though I do appreciate the fact that the water is not hyper smoothed over and actually looks like water.</td>', 'A classic style of image.  Though I do appreciate the fact that the water is not hyper smoothed over and actually looks like water.', '2010-01-02 16:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791569, 843254, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice fun capture, the barrel of water create a nice element of drama.  The colours appear in the mid range and I am wondering how it would change the image if they were pushed in either direction.</td>', 'Nice fun capture, the barrel of water create a nice element of drama.  The colours appear in the mid range and I am wondering how it would change the image if they were pushed in either direction.', '2010-01-02 16:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791570, 843226, 16197, '<td valign="top">Strong structure, vibrant colour, though it appears smoothed over and for me that losses appeal.  Personally I would have enjoyed the more dramatic, dirty grunge then the smooth washed over look.</td>', 'Strong structure, vibrant colour, though it appears smoothed over and for me that losses appeal.  Personally I would have enjoyed the more dramatic, dirty grunge then the smooth washed over look.', '2010-01-02 16:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791575, 842930, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image not only because of the clarity of pig-head but also because of the nonchalant nature of the gentleman in the back.  It really demonstrates the difference in people.  Whereas many people who never seen this type of ware being sold find a curious discuss or intriguing mortality to it.  Whereas the guy who sells them for a living is just ho-hum because it is what it is.  A Pig head hanging from a nail.</td>', 'This is a fun image not only because of the clarity of pig-head but also because of the nonchalant nature of the gentleman in the back.  It really demonstrates the difference in people.  Whereas many people who never seen this type of ware being sold find a curious discuss or intriguing mortality to it.  Whereas the guy who sells them for a living is just ho-hum because it is what it is.  A Pig head hanging from a nail.', '2010-01-02 16:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791577, 838577, 16197, '<td valign="top">There is something about this piece that is appealing.  It is not the typical type of portrait, though it has nice lighting and contrast.  Just something nice.  Could be just as a whole it is a nice image.  Not fantastic, breath-taking or extraordinary.  But it is nice.</td>', 'There is something about this piece that is appealing.  It is not the typical type of portrait, though it has nice lighting and contrast.  Just something nice.  Could be just as a whole it is a nice image.  Not fantastic, breath-taking or extraordinary.  But it is nice.', '2010-01-02 16:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791579, 841923, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the rich colour of the sky.  The ground offers a bit of interest for me.  But overall there is something lacking to make it something more.</td>', 'I enjoy the rich colour of the sky.  The ground offers a bit of interest for me.  But overall there is something lacking to make it something more.', '2010-01-02 16:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791580, 843301, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the fun appeal of this image.  So many times we have seen this same scene in people.  The clarity, lighting and contrasts are nicely done as well as the dof.</td>', 'I really enjoy the fun appeal of this image.  So many times we have seen this same scene in people.  The clarity, lighting and contrasts are nicely done as well as the dof.', '2010-01-02 16:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791582, 843207, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a great animal portrait.  Makes you wonder how long they have been around people watching them.  They pose out perfectly it appears.</td>', 'This is a great animal portrait.  Makes you wonder how long they have been around people watching them.  They pose out perfectly it appears.', '2010-01-02 16:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791583, 841855, 16197, '<td valign="top">For me the one thing that bothers me is there appears to be an over-smoothed surface to this image.  There is so much dramatic appeal possible here but just seems lost.  Though still a nice image.</td>', 'For me the one thing that bothers me is there appears to be an over-smoothed surface to this image.  There is so much dramatic appeal possible here but just seems lost.  Though still a nice image.', '2010-01-02 16:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791584, 842924, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image, typical style.  Though for me it is not as clean as it could be.  Though it was well done.</td>', 'Nice simple image, typical style.  Though for me it is not as clean as it could be.  Though it was well done.', '2010-01-02 16:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791586, 843107, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the clarity and contrasts of this piece.  It has a nice balance to it but something is missing to really make it pop and stand out.</td>', 'I enjoy the clarity and contrasts of this piece.  It has a nice balance to it but something is missing to really make it pop and stand out.', '2010-01-02 16:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791588, 839636, 16197, '<td valign="top">I find this imaging appealing.  The long-exposure created a nice background of cloud motion that works nice against the stark sharpness of the lights and buildings.</td>', 'I find this imaging appealing.  The long-exposure created a nice background of cloud motion that works nice against the stark sharpness of the lights and buildings.', '2010-01-02 16:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
