(5791820, 843130, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot.  Im sure the relatives/owners of both the child and horses find this extremely cute.  However for me, being neither a fan of either I will say the clarity is nice, the composition I don''t care for.  Too centered with the action.  The colours are nicely contrasted and the dof works.  Just does not pop for me.</td>', 'Cute snapshot.  Im sure the relatives/owners of both the child and horses find this extremely cute.  However for me, being neither a fan of either I will say the clarity is nice, the composition I don''t care for.  Too centered with the action.  The colours are nicely contrasted and the dof works.  Just does not pop for me.', '2010-01-02 18:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
