(5791851, 843231, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is an ok image for me.  I have issue with timed water motions.  Personally I would have enjoyed something more ''real'' in feeling.  The ice adds a nice element but at this angle the drama is not there.  I would have liked something with a bit more emotion in it. more drama more contrast.  Overall it is ok.</td>', 'This is an ok image for me.  I have issue with timed water motions.  Personally I would have enjoyed something more ''real'' in feeling.  The ice adds a nice element but at this angle the drama is not there.  I would have liked something with a bit more emotion in it. more drama more contrast.  Overall it is ok.', '2010-01-02 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791852, 840929, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like the uniformity of lines paired with the curving shapes of this architectural abstract. The muted tri-tones blend well together to make a cohesive balanced whole. The one bit of enhanced illumination is spot on.</td>', 'I like the uniformity of lines paired with the curving shapes of this architectural abstract. The muted tri-tones blend well together to make a cohesive balanced whole. The one bit of enhanced illumination is spot on.', '2010-01-02 19:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
