(5791854, 843150, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot.  The center composition does not hold well for me. But the setup is nice.  I would have hoped for something a bit stronger though.  Maybe modify the area so the lights were not so strong and that there were cleaner reflections on the globe.</td>', 'Cute snapshot.  The center composition does not hold well for me. But the setup is nice.  I would have hoped for something a bit stronger though.  Maybe modify the area so the lights were not so strong and that there were cleaner reflections on the globe.', '2010-01-02 19:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
