(5791866, 843134, 16197, '<td valign="top">An interesting image.  With the figure standing there and the streak of light.  I don''t understand the connection to the title however.  Yet this is only slightly interesting and does not really do anything for me.</td>', 'An interesting image.  With the figure standing there and the streak of light.  I don''t understand the connection to the title however.  Yet this is only slightly interesting and does not really do anything for me.', '2010-01-02 19:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791867, 842760, 111808, '<td valign="top">Wow - this is superb - muted calm soft sea paired with the crystal clarity of the detailed ice chunk and the smaller icicles each definitively &amp; individually captured in striking contrast. I like the texture of the rising rock surrounded by the mists. There is something ancient and primeval about this image.</td>', 'Wow - this is superb - muted calm soft sea paired with the crystal clarity of the detailed ice chunk and the smaller icicles each definitively & individually captured in striking contrast. I like the texture of the rising rock surrounded by the mists. There is something ancient and primeval about this image.', '2010-01-02 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
