(5791871, 842600, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is kinda fun.  I only say kinda because the large x is a distraction in the main image however I see in the ball what its too and it works there.  Just not in the larger image.  Also there is a type of clarity I am missing.  Something just does not seem to hold it together.  However it is creatively capture and composed.</td>', 'This is kinda fun.  I only say kinda because the large x is a distraction in the main image however I see in the ball what its too and it works there.  Just not in the larger image.  Also there is a type of clarity I am missing.  Something just does not seem to hold it together.  However it is creatively capture and composed.', '2010-01-02 19:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791887, 843010, 111808, '<td valign="top">Festive and cheerful these fancy and quite beautiful steeds, almost like 3 wise avatars of the equine variety. This would make a perfect Christmas card.</td>', 'Festive and cheerful these fancy and quite beautiful steeds, almost like 3 wise avatars of the equine variety. This would make a perfect Christmas card.', '2010-01-02 19:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791892, 840994, 111808, '<td valign="top">This wide angle seascape vista is stunning - each cleft of rock covered in shallow reflective tidepool, each softly blended wave and beyond that the vast expanse of calm water, each defined cloud of the echoing skyscape and the tinge of colour to the right all enhancing each of the other elements. This is Photography elevated to the categorization of Art. Superbly beautiful, I could look at this for hours.</td>', 'This wide angle seascape vista is stunning - each cleft of rock covered in shallow reflective tidepool, each softly blended wave and beyond that the vast expanse of calm water, each defined cloud of the echoing skyscape and the tinge of colour to the right all enhancing each of the other elements. This is Photography elevated to the categorization of Art. Superbly beautiful, I could look at this for hours.', '2010-01-02 19:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791902, 842996, 111808, '<td valign="top">I have seen many beautiful photographs of dewed webs but this is the first I have seen of the dewy occupant and architect of those creations. Unusual point of view, exquisite macro and just the thought reinforced once again of how wondrous is Nature.</td>', 'I have seen many beautiful photographs of dewed webs but this is the first I have seen of the dewy occupant and architect of those creations. Unusual point of view, exquisite macro and just the thought reinforced once again of how wondrous is Nature.', '2010-01-02 19:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791911, 842812, 111808, '<td valign="top">Unusual treatment of this photographic capture works quite well. The red eye of course is what the viewer immediately goes to but then the black and white defines every fin, every spot, every gill and makes you see the beauty of the Fish. A new way of looking at a less than oft considered subject.</td>', 'Unusual treatment of this photographic capture works quite well. The red eye of course is what the viewer immediately goes to but then the black and white defines every fin, every spot, every gill and makes you see the beauty of the Fish. A new way of looking at a less than oft considered subject.', '2010-01-02 19:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5791922, 842704, 111808, '<td valign="top">Be like the water young Caine and go with the flow, let the true course of Nature be within your soul and you will know the correct path.<br/>Superbly gorgeous macro and I like how the dewdrops the creature is holding reflects the larger cosmos of the world beyond the perch, like a miniature crystal ball providing enlightenment.</td>', 'Be like the water young Caine and go with the flow, let the true course of Nature be within your soul and you will know the correct path.Superbly gorgeous macro and I like how the dewdrops the creature is holding reflects the larger cosmos of the world beyond the perch, like a miniature crystal ball providing enlightenment.', '2010-01-02 19:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
