(5792196, 843181, 16197, '<td valign="top">This looks like a nice place to capture images.  However for me this one just does not grab me.  It appears overly dark and with a lack of interesting details.  I would liked to have seen something more dramatic within this piece.</td>', 'This looks like a nice place to capture images.  However for me this one just does not grab me.  It appears overly dark and with a lack of interesting details.  I would liked to have seen something more dramatic within this piece.', '2010-01-02 22:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
