(5792226, 843317, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting tree/root system.  What a great find.  Though the simple image gives it no justice in my opinion.  I would have liked to see some depth created within the image to really make the roots pop out and really give a sense of the concrete forest you hint at with the title.</td>', 'This is an interesting tree/root system.  What a great find.  Though the simple image gives it no justice in my opinion.  I would have liked to see some depth created within the image to really make the roots pop out and really give a sense of the concrete forest you hint at with the title.', '2010-01-02 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792230, 843295, 16197, '<td valign="top">A nice clean portrait of a dog running towards the camera.  I am sure you are very fond of this image, which I suspect is your dog.  However, for an outside viewer there is not much of interest.  It is clean, its cute. a nice snapshot but nothing more.</td>', 'A nice clean portrait of a dog running towards the camera.  I am sure you are very fond of this image, which I suspect is your dog.  However, for an outside viewer there is not much of interest.  It is clean, its cute. a nice snapshot but nothing more.', '2010-01-02 22:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792231, 843214, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and creative image.  Though I am assuming this will fall under the no photographs of artwork rule.  Not really much here to wow me with.  Though maybe someone will enjoy it.</td>', 'Very artistic and creative image.  Though I am assuming this will fall under the no photographs of artwork rule.  Not really much here to wow me with.  Though maybe someone will enjoy it.', '2010-01-02 22:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792232, 838589, 16197, '<td valign="top">The colours and silhouette of the trees are nice.  But there is something missing to really blow me down.  its nice but it isn''t wow.</td>', 'The colours and silhouette of the trees are nice.  But there is something missing to really blow me down.  its nice but it isn''t wow.', '2010-01-02 22:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792234, 841062, 16197, '<td valign="top">Smoke, I love smoke for lots of different things.  Only most of them are as supporting elements and not the main focus.  For good reason.  Though granted there are those rare exceptions of smoke that can stand alone.  This isn''t one of them.  This is just ok to me.</td>', 'Smoke, I love smoke for lots of different things.  Only most of them are as supporting elements and not the main focus.  For good reason.  Though granted there are those rare exceptions of smoke that can stand alone.  This isn''t one of them.  This is just ok to me.', '2010-01-02 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792237, 842925, 16197, '<td valign="top">Something fun about this image but also something manufactured.  It is as if a brush was taken to make all the trees and stuff.  Easily this can be a piece of traditional artwork and not a photograph.  Maybe, maybe not.  But the question is there.</td>', 'Something fun about this image but also something manufactured.  It is as if a brush was taken to make all the trees and stuff.  Easily this can be a piece of traditional artwork and not a photograph.  Maybe, maybe not.  But the question is there.', '2010-01-02 22:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792240, 843281, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot from the zoo.  The contrast is almost there but the colours seem muted and dull to me.  I would have liked to see this with more depth and vibrance then I bet the viewer would believe they could jump off the screen.</td>', 'Cute snapshot from the zoo.  The contrast is almost there but the colours seem muted and dull to me.  I would have liked to see this with more depth and vibrance then I bet the viewer would believe they could jump off the screen.', '2010-01-02 22:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792241, 842965, 16197, '<td valign="top">This may fall under the no pictures of existing artwork rule.  It appears the main focus is the figure.  Though I don''t really understand at all what you are trying say here, for me, I find this an ok snapshot.</td>', 'This may fall under the no pictures of existing artwork rule.  It appears the main focus is the figure.  Though I don''t really understand at all what you are trying say here, for me, I find this an ok snapshot.', '2010-01-02 22:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792242, 842928, 16197, '<td valign="top">The water certainly does look chilly.  Yet, the image as a whole just does not give me a strong sense of cold.  The warm colours and the huge distance with more warm colours say to me that it is warming up, not freezing.</td>', 'The water certainly does look chilly.  Yet, the image as a whole just does not give me a strong sense of cold.  The warm colours and the huge distance with more warm colours say to me that it is warming up, not freezing.', '2010-01-02 22:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
