(5792258, 843227, 16197, '<td valign="top">The colours are nice but the blurriness of the image is a distraction for me and does not appeal.  But like I said the colours are nice and the composition is decent.</td>', 'The colours are nice but the blurriness of the image is a distraction for me and does not appeal.  But like I said the colours are nice and the composition is decent.', '2010-01-02 22:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792262, 840924, 16197, '<td valign="top">This has potential. The contrasts work well as does the blurred clouds and strong structural lines.  Just does not push enough for me, this perspective may be nice, much nicer than straight on, but the huge dark square in the lower middle frame just makes the viewer feel as if their view is blocked and they cannot see the whole picture.</td>', 'This has potential. The contrasts work well as does the blurred clouds and strong structural lines.  Just does not push enough for me, this perspective may be nice, much nicer than straight on, but the huge dark square in the lower middle frame just makes the viewer feel as if their view is blocked and they cannot see the whole picture.', '2010-01-02 22:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792264, 837509, 16197, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour on the clouds and the hill has nice clarity.  It is a lovely scenic shot but does not give me enough pop for the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely colour on the clouds and the hill has nice clarity.  It is a lovely scenic shot but does not give me enough pop for the challenge.', '2010-01-02 22:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792268, 842801, 16197, '<td valign="top">The item on the left appears to be a giraffe in the water.  I cannot clearly see what it is and with the dark nature of the image it distracts.  I am assuming I am looking at water because of small elements which give it away but overall there is no appeal.</td>', 'The item on the left appears to be a giraffe in the water.  I cannot clearly see what it is and with the dark nature of the image it distracts.  I am assuming I am looking at water because of small elements which give it away but overall there is no appeal.', '2010-01-02 22:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792272, 839717, 16197, '<td valign="top">For me, there is no appeal to this image.  Because of the style I cannot or I should say it is difficult to make the difference between the frozen water and the extended water.  The fall appears to be a huge pile of bright snow but there is nothing there to tell me water.  For me it just does not hold any weight.</td>', 'For me, there is no appeal to this image.  Because of the style I cannot or I should say it is difficult to make the difference between the frozen water and the extended water.  The fall appears to be a huge pile of bright snow but there is nothing there to tell me water.  For me it just does not hold any weight.', '2010-01-02 22:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792275, 843088, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the concept here.  Though for me, I think with how well this can stand out it would have been served better to capture it later at night with a wider shot so it could be a beacon of sorts in the woods.</td>', 'I enjoy the concept here.  Though for me, I think with how well this can stand out it would have been served better to capture it later at night with a wider shot so it could be a beacon of sorts in the woods.', '2010-01-02 22:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792280, 843228, 16197, '<td valign="top">This room has so much potential for great photography.  However the dreamy effect used here does not offer it.  It appears to have a slight blur on everything and does not pop like I would expect it too.  The mid-range contrasts are extremely flat and offer no depth of character with all that texture.</td>', 'This room has so much potential for great photography.  However the dreamy effect used here does not offer it.  It appears to have a slight blur on everything and does not pop like I would expect it too.  The mid-range contrasts are extremely flat and offer no depth of character with all that texture.', '2010-01-02 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5792283, 843201, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that I just can''t put your finger on an exact reason why it appeals to me...I''ll just say that I like it!</td>', 'This is one of those that I just can''t put your finger on an exact reason why it appeals to me...I''ll just say that I like it!', '2010-01-02 23:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
