(5793213, 838220, 86218, '<td valign="top">This is really beautifull. Of course a beautifull woman but the lighting handeled very well and super sharp. Love the comp. Only thing of bother is the shadow line on left as well as orange stick? running over her right shoulder up but this is hyper critical. Im not very good at taking people like this and more candid so i can really appreciate the difficulty of getting things right like this. 8</td>', 'This is really beautifull. Of course a beautifull woman but the lighting handeled very well and super sharp. Love the comp. Only thing of bother is the shadow line on left as well as orange stick? running over her right shoulder up but this is hyper critical. Im not very good at taking people like this and more candid so i can really appreciate the difficulty of getting things right like this. 8', '2010-01-03 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
