(5793246, 841566, 108982, '<td valign="top">love this style of photo.  almost a candid as a model or actress preps for a shoot.  I think you caught the true essence of this woman''s beauty in the photo.  really like the softer highlights and strong back-lighting.  excellent use of a slightly older looking model and showing the patience and calmness in her eyes.  Also really like the pin-up style hair choice.  all in all a picture I have seen in my own mind when thinking of how I would shoot a beautiful woman.  bravo...10</td>', 'love this style of photo.  almost a candid as a model or actress preps for a shoot.  I think you caught the true essence of this woman''s beauty in the photo.  really like the softer highlights and strong back-lighting.  excellent use of a slightly older looking model and showing the patience and calmness in her eyes.  Also really like the pin-up style hair choice.  all in all a picture I have seen in my own mind when thinking of how I would shoot a beautiful woman.  bravo...10', '2010-01-03 14:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793259, 841444, 24666, '<td valign="top">Came back to bump this score up some . A very deserved 10 , everything about this pic is fabulous and the choice not to have colour is inspired. If this doesn''t ribbon there is no justice a beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Came back to bump this score up some . A very deserved 10 , everything about this pic is fabulous and the choice not to have colour is inspired. If this doesn''t ribbon there is no justice a beautiful portrait.', '2010-01-03 14:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793267, 843303, 16197, '<td valign="top">For me it is difficult to see ''volcano'' in this image.  I see  a slight mount but that could be just a mound.  Also the colours appear very muted and I would have liked a bit more PoP in them as well as some dramatic contrasts.  However, the near center waterline offers very little interest on the bottom of the image while the top because of the faded muted colour is nearly the same.</td>', 'For me it is difficult to see ''volcano'' in this image.  I see  a slight mount but that could be just a mound.  Also the colours appear very muted and I would have liked a bit more PoP in them as well as some dramatic contrasts.  However, the near center waterline offers very little interest on the bottom of the image while the top because of the faded muted colour is nearly the same.', '2010-01-03 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793268, 842958, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the edges seem a little unnatural, and clipping the top pedals is a bit of a miss.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the edges seem a little unnatural, and clipping the top pedals is a bit of a miss.', '2010-01-03 14:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793271, 843115, 16197, '<td valign="top">I dig the groovy perspective here.  Now if it went to infinity it would have been great, but I see the end.  I like the old wooden pier/bridge.  However I also would have liked a bit more drama in the processing.  Something to really bring out the character and personality of the old wood grain.  Overall for me it is just so-so but it has potential to being something more.</td>', 'I dig the groovy perspective here.  Now if it went to infinity it would have been great, but I see the end.  I like the old wooden pier/bridge.  However I also would have liked a bit more drama in the processing.  Something to really bring out the character and personality of the old wood grain.  Overall for me it is just so-so but it has potential to being something more.', '2010-01-03 14:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793274, 838554, 16197, '<td valign="top">Lovely snowy scene.  Yet for me it just is not enough.  It is nice, I could see it on a postcard or something.  But for me, there is an element of wow missing.</td>', 'Lovely snowy scene.  Yet for me it just is not enough.  It is nice, I could see it on a postcard or something.  But for me, there is an element of wow missing.', '2010-01-03 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793275, 843127, 105441, '<td valign="top">Great pattern, warm colors.  It would be more interesting if there was a great sky in the reflections, such as a sunrise or sunset.</td>', 'Great pattern, warm colors.  It would be more interesting if there was a great sky in the reflections, such as a sunrise or sunset.', '2010-01-03 14:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793276, 843202, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the object in lower right is not recognizable so I find it distracting rather than a focal point.</td>', 'Nice sky, but the object in lower right is not recognizable so I find it distracting rather than a focal point.', '2010-01-03 14:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793277, 842597, 16197, '<td valign="top">Clever concept.  The colours work well and what is in focus has nice clarity.  However two major faults for me is the center composition of the syringe as well as the extremely narrow focal plain.  Also I wish I could see the tip of the syringe.  I bet it would have doe a lot better if you could have gotten a drip off the needle tip with the coffeebeans as a background and not so much the main.</td>', 'Clever concept.  The colours work well and what is in focus has nice clarity.  However two major faults for me is the center composition of the syringe as well as the extremely narrow focal plain.  Also I wish I could see the tip of the syringe.  I bet it would have doe a lot better if you could have gotten a drip off the needle tip with the coffeebeans as a background and not so much the main.', '2010-01-03 14:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793278, 839423, 105441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful night scene from down under.  Nicely exposed.</td>', 'Beautiful night scene from down under.  Nicely exposed.', '2010-01-03 14:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793280, 842850, 16197, '<td valign="top">Lovely clarity on the in-focus bits.  However for me, there is not a tone of interest.  It looks nice, but I hope for more focal depth to see all the pebbles as well as some added personality.</td>', 'Lovely clarity on the in-focus bits.  However for me, there is not a tone of interest.  It looks nice, but I hope for more focal depth to see all the pebbles as well as some added personality.', '2010-01-03 14:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793282, 841599, 105441, '<td valign="top">Brrrrr!  Great capture, and I love the snow or sleet coming down diagonally.   One of my fav''s.</td>', 'Brrrrr!  Great capture, and I love the snow or sleet coming down diagonally.   One of my fav''s.', '2010-01-03 14:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793284, 843110, 16197, '<td valign="top">It is a lovely scene, the streak of orange through the cooler blues are nice.  However for me, I miss where it is frosty and I feel there is so much potential in the rocks and clouds but they do not currently hold enough dramatic appeal to me.</td>', 'It is a lovely scene, the streak of orange through the cooler blues are nice.  However for me, I miss where it is frosty and I feel there is so much potential in the rocks and clouds but they do not currently hold enough dramatic appeal to me.', '2010-01-03 14:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793285, 841567, 105441, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but would prefer if the woman''s face was not obscured.</td>', 'I like the shot, but would prefer if the woman''s face was not obscured.', '2010-01-03 14:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793288, 842159, 16197, '<td valign="top">A lovely capture, however the center framing is a distraction as well as the distance. I think a tighter crop and a following of the rule of 1/3''s would really make this a stronger image.  The colours and contrasts can be pushed up a touch but just enough to make it pop.</td>', 'A lovely capture, however the center framing is a distraction as well as the distance. I think a tighter crop and a following of the rule of 1/3''s would really make this a stronger image.  The colours and contrasts can be pushed up a touch but just enough to make it pop.', '2010-01-03 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793289, 842203, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice color, clarity, and contrast.</td>', 'Nice color, clarity, and contrast.', '2010-01-03 14:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793291, 843106, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, perhaps too much foreground?</td>', 'Nice exposure, perhaps too much foreground?', '2010-01-03 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
