(5793294, 843051, 16197, '<td valign="top">The center alignment of the clock for me is distracting.  I understand it is where you got your title but there is no real understanding or appeal to the average viewer as to why.  At least not to this viewer.  The motion of the train is interesting and I wonder if I am seeing a reflection of the other wall or seeing through the train.  I think there is a lot of possible character here just it was not brought out for me.</td>', 'The center alignment of the clock for me is distracting.  I understand it is where you got your title but there is no real understanding or appeal to the average viewer as to why.  At least not to this viewer.  The motion of the train is interesting and I wonder if I am seeing a reflection of the other wall or seeing through the train.  I think there is a lot of possible character here just it was not brought out for me.', '2010-01-03 14:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793296, 843221, 105441, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, would like to see all of the palm tree.</td>', 'Nice contrast, would like to see all of the palm tree.', '2010-01-03 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793297, 841628, 16197, '<td valign="top">This could be a cute image for horse lovers.  The scene is pleasant enough.  However it does not pop or scream at me.  It is nice but not extraordinary.</td>', 'This could be a cute image for horse lovers.  The scene is pleasant enough.  However it does not pop or scream at me.  It is nice but not extraordinary.', '2010-01-03 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793298, 840558, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the background as well as the clarity of line on the feathers.  However it appears he is a bit out of focus or that it drops off rather quickly.  I would have hoped for a sharper more clear view of the whole bird and not just the tips of the wings.</td>', 'I enjoy the background as well as the clarity of line on the feathers.  However it appears he is a bit out of focus or that it drops off rather quickly.  I would have hoped for a sharper more clear view of the whole bird and not just the tips of the wings.', '2010-01-03 14:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
