(5793405, 842058, 10785, '<td valign="top">I can''t see anything wrong with this except maybe that people might like to see the rule of thirds applied to the horizon line, rather than splitting the image halfway with the horizon line. That is a personal preference though. It has beautiful golden tones and the conposition with the streak of the sunset and the person is spot on.</td>', 'I can''t see anything wrong with this except maybe that people might like to see the rule of thirds applied to the horizon line, rather than splitting the image halfway with the horizon line. That is a personal preference though. It has beautiful golden tones and the conposition with the streak of the sunset and the person is spot on.', '2010-01-03 16:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793409, 843176, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent exposure given the level of difficulty with the range of light available.</td>', 'This is an excellent exposure given the level of difficulty with the range of light available.', '2010-01-03 16:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
