(5793952, 842818, 76335, '<td valign="top">I know they get a bad rap, but I always thought they were beautiful birds. You show it off nicely here.</td>', 'I know they get a bad rap, but I always thought they were beautiful birds. You show it off nicely here.', '2010-01-03 21:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5793989, 841707, 75034, '<td valign="top">Knowing how this shot was done and knowing how the lighting was done and the hair, make-up and and and and there is only one thing I can do, wish you all the best Leo and tell you that I''m very thankful that you share your knowledge with me. I''m getting better and I owe most of that to you. You are a great friend and I look forward to sharing more laughs and photographs with you in the future.<br/> <br/>This is a fantastic vision of what you saw in your head and I''m really glad I was there to learn and help. I had a fantastic time.<br/> <br/>You know the guy who set up the hair light really knew what he was doing, it''s spot on :)<br/> <br/>All the best to you and I''m sure this will hit the top three.<br/> <br/>Sadly no vote from me.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Knowing how this shot was done and knowing how the lighting was done and the hair, make-up and and and and there is only one thing I can do, wish you all the best Leo and tell you that I''m very thankful that you share your knowledge with me. I''m getting better and I owe most of that to you. You are a great friend and I look forward to sharing more laughs and photographs with you in the future. This is a fantastic vision of what you saw in your head and I''m really glad I was there to learn and help. I had a fantastic time. You know the guy who set up the hair light really knew what he was doing, it''s spot on :) All the best to you and I''m sure this will hit the top three. Sadly no vote from me. MAX!', '2010-01-03 21:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
