(5796329, 841432, 19641, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Not sure about the composition but the exposure looks dead on.  The model is perfect for this shot.  She''s a good sport...  Looks very cold!</td>', 'Great shot!  Not sure about the composition but the exposure looks dead on.  The model is perfect for this shot.  She''s a good sport...  Looks very cold!', '2010-01-04 22:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
