(5796348, 841642, 19641, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model and great use of lighting!  Makes the shot very interesting.  My only gripe would be the distracting background.</td>', 'Beautiful model and great use of lighting!  Makes the shot very interesting.  My only gripe would be the distracting background.', '2010-01-04 22:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
