(5796354, 841950, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the idea and the execution. The grain is fantastic. 9</td>', 'Great shot. I love the idea and the execution. The grain is fantastic. 9', '2010-01-04 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796358, 841497, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice diagonal shot.</td>', 'Very nice diagonal shot.', '2010-01-04 22:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796359, 841315, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, no idea what it is.  But it is interesting.  That being said I wish I could tell more of what it was, make a connection of some sorts.  Something to help me relate to the image and once I did that it would be more clear as to the concept.  But as it is now, it just does not do it for me.</td>', 'Interesting image, no idea what it is.  But it is interesting.  That being said I wish I could tell more of what it was, make a connection of some sorts.  Something to help me relate to the image and once I did that it would be more clear as to the concept.  But as it is now, it just does not do it for me.', '2010-01-04 22:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796361, 841748, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail. Nice composition.</td>', 'Excellent detail. Nice composition.', '2010-01-04 22:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796362, 841754, 23484, '<td valign="top">Escaped.</td>', 'Escaped.', '2010-01-04 22:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796364, 841748, 19641, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is great!  I love how the face fills the frame!  Only issue I see is the focus is on the nose instead of the eyes.</td>', 'Wow!  This is great!  I love how the face fills the frame!  Only issue I see is the focus is on the nose instead of the eyes.', '2010-01-04 22:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796365, 839829, 23484, '<td valign="top">Wow, fantastic view. I''ll bet this would be a cool shot even without the fog.</td>', 'Wow, fantastic view. I''ll bet this would be a cool shot even without the fog.', '2010-01-04 22:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796405, 842929, 93565, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how the lower flower appears to be a reflection due to its shaded hue, but, upon closer inspection, is in fact a separate flower below the top one. Interesting flowers and a non-distracting background make for a nice photo, but I am not altogether a fan of the border. It''s tone is too similar to that of the flowers.</td>', 'It''s interesting how the lower flower appears to be a reflection due to its shaded hue, but, upon closer inspection, is in fact a separate flower below the top one. Interesting flowers and a non-distracting background make for a nice photo, but I am not altogether a fan of the border. It''s tone is too similar to that of the flowers.', '2010-01-04 23:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796426, 838220, 19641, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!!!  Far better than any portrait I''ve every taken.  If I had to pick a flaw I would say it''s the foliage at the bottom right.  It seems to take up just a little too much of the space.</td>', 'Amazing shot!!!  Far better than any portrait I''ve every taken.  If I had to pick a flaw I would say it''s the foliage at the bottom right.  It seems to take up just a little too much of the space.', '2010-01-04 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796428, 842952, 83313, '<td valign="top">The horse looks somewhat distorted to me. Otherwise, I think this would have been pretty good.</td>', 'The horse looks somewhat distorted to me. Otherwise, I think this would have been pretty good.', '2010-01-04 23:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796434, 842965, 83313, '<td valign="top">Attack of the zombie swiss army knife!!! One of my favorite movies, right after "Attack of the killer tomatoes".<br/> <br/>Extra pointage for giving me a nice opportunity to leave one of my idiotic comments.</td>', 'Attack of the zombie swiss army knife!!! One of my favorite movies, right after "Attack of the killer tomatoes". Extra pointage for giving me a nice opportunity to leave one of my idiotic comments.', '2010-01-04 23:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796440, 840793, 83313, '<td valign="top">Lots of visible artifacts, watch the amount of JPEG compression you use. Compression kills detail and at 72k in size, this image has LOTS of compression working against it.  Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.</td>', 'Lots of visible artifacts, watch the amount of JPEG compression you use. Compression kills detail and at 72k in size, this image has LOTS of compression working against it.  Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit.', '2010-01-04 23:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796446, 841655, 16197, '<td valign="top">The textures are interesting but not sure I really care for the figure from behind.  They seem misplaced and not really connected to the image.  It is interesting concept however.</td>', 'The textures are interesting but not sure I really care for the figure from behind.  They seem misplaced and not really connected to the image.  It is interesting concept however.', '2010-01-04 23:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796447, 842613, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very cute find.  Little guy likes posing it seems as well.  I would have liked a bit more sharpness in his fer as well as a little more separation of details.</td>', 'Very cute find.  Little guy likes posing it seems as well.  I would have liked a bit more sharpness in his fer as well as a little more separation of details.', '2010-01-04 23:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796448, 843106, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I am sure it has several commercial uses, especially with that huge amount of white-space.  Though for me in this setting, the extra white-space is annoying and unneeded.  I want to see the tree and fence, not dead air.</td>', 'Interesting image, I am sure it has several commercial uses, especially with that huge amount of white-space.  Though for me in this setting, the extra white-space is annoying and unneeded.  I want to see the tree and fence, not dead air.', '2010-01-04 23:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796472, 841671, 81362, '<td valign="top">r<br/>edited to complete the thought:<br/>Sorry about the mystery letter, which appears to have been an inadvertent slip of the fingers. <br/> <br/>The spikes of frost make this look at first glance like a cactus in winter. Interesting to have a bit of residual green along with the muted red. The composition seems a bit static dead center. A shift of position to put the branch more toward the diagonal might lend a more dynamic feeling (but I don''t know what you had to work with).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-11 12:25:27.</i></td>', 'redited to complete the thought:Sorry about the mystery letter, which appears to have been an inadvertent slip of the fingers.  The spikes of frost make this look at first glance like a cactus in winter. Interesting to have a bit of residual green along with the muted red. The composition seems a bit static dead center. A shift of position to put the branch more toward the diagonal might lend a more dynamic feeling (but I don''t know what you had to work with).', '2010-01-05 00:03:42.000000', '2010-01-11 12:25:27.000000', 1),
(5796476, 840383, 83313, '<td valign="top">You''d really be upset if I slammed this pic with a 1 or a 2, wouldn''t you? Nah, I won''t do that. I''ve seen this lighthouse in many challenges and this is one of the better shots out of a lot of really good ones.<br/> <br/>Added: I''ve seen a really bad one too. They gave us a calendar at work last year and it had a shot of this lighthouse that reinvents the term "oversharpened". Hope they didn''t pay much for that shot.</td>', 'You''d really be upset if I slammed this pic with a 1 or a 2, wouldn''t you? Nah, I won''t do that. I''ve seen this lighthouse in many challenges and this is one of the better shots out of a lot of really good ones. Added: I''ve seen a really bad one too. They gave us a calendar at work last year and it had a shot of this lighthouse that reinvents the term "oversharpened". Hope they didn''t pay much for that shot.', '2010-01-05 00:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796544, 842838, 69668, '<td valign="top">Cool image!!!</td>', 'Cool image!!!', '2010-01-05 02:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796548, 842633, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a great fine.  Though for me it is a bit soft and light in colour.  I would really have enjoyed a much richer colour with stronger contrast of the stump to make it pop just a bit more and really show off its character and personality.</td>', 'This is a great fine.  Though for me it is a bit soft and light in colour.  I would really have enjoyed a much richer colour with stronger contrast of the stump to make it pop just a bit more and really show off its character and personality.', '2010-01-05 03:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796551, 841880, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting piece.  I find the black/white treatment works well for this application.  I am curious if she is standing in a stairwell and actually someone you know, or if you/us are really a voyeur into this persons life.  The near center composition is a bit off putting, however I will forgive you this time.  This image also is a bit nicer this second time around so I will give you a slight bump in your score.  Overall its a nice image and concept.</td>', 'This is an interesting piece.  I find the black/white treatment works well for this application.  I am curious if she is standing in a stairwell and actually someone you know, or if you/us are really a voyeur into this persons life.  The near center composition is a bit off putting, however I will forgive you this time.  This image also is a bit nicer this second time around so I will give you a slight bump in your score.  Overall its a nice image and concept.', '2010-01-05 03:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796552, 843353, 16197, '<td valign="top">I view this image and I prefer I did not.  I really do not enjoy the processing of this image.  Sure the colours pop but there is a complete loss of detail. For me the affect used did not enhance the image but rather turned it from a photograph into a digital piece.  Loss of innocence is what I would say.</td>', 'I view this image and I prefer I did not.  I really do not enjoy the processing of this image.  Sure the colours pop but there is a complete loss of detail. For me the affect used did not enhance the image but rather turned it from a photograph into a digital piece.  Loss of innocence is what I would say.', '2010-01-05 03:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5796756, 843252, 19944, '<td valign="top">I would have given you an 8, but it has a lighthouse, so you get a 9 instead.<br/> <br/>I really like the softness</td>', 'I would have given you an 8, but it has a lighthouse, so you get a 9 instead. I really like the softness', '2010-01-05 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
