(5797407, 838220, 16197, '<td valign="top">I have viewed this image a couple times now, on different days.  There seems to be a strange plastic-like feel to her skin.  Not sure if it is just really smooth skin and light-play or something else.  Anyway, its a nice cute portrait.  Fairly clean and clear.  Just does not wow me.</td>', 'I have viewed this image a couple times now, on different days.  There seems to be a strange plastic-like feel to her skin.  Not sure if it is just really smooth skin and light-play or something else.  Anyway, its a nice cute portrait.  Fairly clean and clear.  Just does not wow me.', '2010-01-05 18:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797409, 843230, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The clarity is nice.  the colours are normal.  I enjoy being able to see the detail on the bird.  I think after this viewing I will bump your score a bit.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The clarity is nice.  the colours are normal.  I enjoy being able to see the detail on the bird.  I think after this viewing I will bump your score a bit.', '2010-01-05 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797413, 843247, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy everything except the processing.  The angle of the hill and line of the horizon are nice.  The variance of animal colour is nice.   The balance of trees within the image and foliage is nice.  However that blurry ''dreamy'' effect has got to go.  It really makes this difficult to enjoy.  Im sure there are,no, I know there are a great number of people who enjoy this technique.  There seems to be a growing trend here.  However for me, it just does not work, it appears too manufactured for my tastes.</td>', 'I enjoy everything except the processing.  The angle of the hill and line of the horizon are nice.  The variance of animal colour is nice.   The balance of trees within the image and foliage is nice.  However that blurry ''dreamy'' effect has got to go.  It really makes this difficult to enjoy.  Im sure there are,no, I know there are a great number of people who enjoy this technique.  There seems to be a growing trend here.  However for me, it just does not work, it appears too manufactured for my tastes.', '2010-01-05 18:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797418, 840754, 16197, '<td valign="top">Lovely horizon line and mirror.  I may not agree with the center composition however.  The colours are nice and neutral though I may have liked a bit more pop in colour as well as character in the clouds.</td>', 'Lovely horizon line and mirror.  I may not agree with the center composition however.  The colours are nice and neutral though I may have liked a bit more pop in colour as well as character in the clouds.', '2010-01-05 18:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797420, 842736, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  It is nice to a point.  The personality in the water due to your longer exposure is nice.  it is not great in my opinion but it is nice.  Yet I would have liked more orange or something more to give personality to the image whole.  There is a glimpse with the structures in the background but they are so small they appear more of a distraction then an intended element.</td>', 'Interesting image.  It is nice to a point.  The personality in the water due to your longer exposure is nice.  it is not great in my opinion but it is nice.  Yet I would have liked more orange or something more to give personality to the image whole.  There is a glimpse with the structures in the background but they are so small they appear more of a distraction then an intended element.', '2010-01-05 18:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797421, 842710, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice fun image of the egret.  However for me it is not as clear as it could be and the profile aspect though can be fun is far to common and uninteresting.</td>', 'Nice fun image of the egret.  However for me it is not as clear as it could be and the profile aspect though can be fun is far to common and uninteresting.', '2010-01-05 18:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797423, 843127, 16197, '<td valign="top">Fun perspective here.  Creative use of the structure, and the colours are nice.  However for me it just does not wow me.  Perhaps there are several possibility of use. But for me, just doesn''t.</td>', 'Fun perspective here.  Creative use of the structure, and the colours are nice.  However for me it just does not wow me.  Perhaps there are several possibility of use. But for me, just doesn''t.', '2010-01-05 18:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797426, 843298, 16197, '<td valign="top">Clean clear portrait.  Focal range appears nice. The white background is off-white so not blowing the image way.  The one arm is a bit interesting, I would have liked to see part of the other arm or something.  Less of course she has only one arm then that really wouldn''t be possible, but Im assuming from the fold of the material there is one, just covered.  it is nice, but just does not wow me.</td>', 'Clean clear portrait.  Focal range appears nice. The white background is off-white so not blowing the image way.  The one arm is a bit interesting, I would have liked to see part of the other arm or something.  Less of course she has only one arm then that really wouldn''t be possible, but Im assuming from the fold of the material there is one, just covered.  it is nice, but just does not wow me.', '2010-01-05 18:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797430, 843258, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of the eye.  The focal lie we can see completely vertical is kinda interesting.  Not sure why you call this Angel Eye, unless the horses name is Angel or you are that into horses.  Which not everyone is.  For me, its nice but does nothing for me.</td>', 'Nice macro of the eye.  The focal lie we can see completely vertical is kinda interesting.  Not sure why you call this Angel Eye, unless the horses name is Angel or you are that into horses.  Which not everyone is.  For me, its nice but does nothing for me.', '2010-01-05 18:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797432, 841999, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait of a kid.  The worried look is interesting with the messy face.  Everything appears clean and well done.  However just does nothing for me.  Does not wow me or connect to me.</td>', 'Cute portrait of a kid.  The worried look is interesting with the messy face.  Everything appears clean and well done.  However just does nothing for me.  Does not wow me or connect to me.', '2010-01-05 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797434, 839292, 16197, '<td valign="top">Not really a style I care for.  The extended effect is popular and many people do. just for me I like my water to look like water.  This is such an interesting place to photograph and I feel that with the effect the detail, personalty and contrasts are lost.  No idea where your Black Pearl is either.  The title does not connect.</td>', 'Not really a style I care for.  The extended effect is popular and many people do. just for me I like my water to look like water.  This is such an interesting place to photograph and I feel that with the effect the detail, personalty and contrasts are lost.  No idea where your Black Pearl is either.  The title does not connect.', '2010-01-05 18:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797435, 840456, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of the critter.  The colours are nice and work well.  However for me there is something flat and perhaps slight out of focus about it.  It just does not pop and give me the clarity I am looking for.</td>', 'Nice macro of the critter.  The colours are nice and work well.  However for me there is something flat and perhaps slight out of focus about it.  It just does not pop and give me the clarity I am looking for.', '2010-01-05 18:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797439, 838147, 16197, '<td valign="top">A nice find.  However for me it is more of a vacation snapshot.  Not knowing the area or being there myself to me it really has no value.  It looks nice but just does nothing for me.</td>', 'A nice find.  However for me it is more of a vacation snapshot.  Not knowing the area or being there myself to me it really has no value.  It looks nice but just does nothing for me.', '2010-01-05 18:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797441, 842760, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting find.  There is some element of mystery here and a sci-fi feel.  It makes me curious as to what monster is coming up out of the steam there.  However it does look like a frame from a b-movie and does not wow me.  It is interesting sure, but does not blow me away.</td>', 'Interesting find.  There is some element of mystery here and a sci-fi feel.  It makes me curious as to what monster is coming up out of the steam there.  However it does look like a frame from a b-movie and does not wow me.  It is interesting sure, but does not blow me away.', '2010-01-05 18:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797442, 842210, 16197, '<td valign="top">Looking at this the second time I am diggin it.  The sun may have burned out that bit a little too much but overall I enjoy the processing.  White-space at the bottom may be a bit much but overall this is nice.  I will give it a slight bump.</td>', 'Looking at this the second time I am diggin it.  The sun may have burned out that bit a little too much but overall I enjoy the processing.  White-space at the bottom may be a bit much but overall this is nice.  I will give it a slight bump.', '2010-01-05 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797443, 839545, 16197, '<td valign="top">There could be high hopes for this.  I have no idea what it is, but I can see potential.  The dof is way too narrow and it leaves everything a bit out of focus.  There may be a very small edge that is in but I cannot see it here.  This piece has the potential, there is a lot of character hidden in there.  Just need to pull it out some.</td>', 'There could be high hopes for this.  I have no idea what it is, but I can see potential.  The dof is way too narrow and it leaves everything a bit out of focus.  There may be a very small edge that is in but I cannot see it here.  This piece has the potential, there is a lot of character hidden in there.  Just need to pull it out some.', '2010-01-05 18:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797447, 841948, 16197, '<td valign="top">I was going to say this is a nice clear image then I saw the red/blue noise in the sand and on the rock followed by the yellow noise in the water.  For me its a bit distracting.  I would say to make this less distracting crop it off just above the stone/rock/formation on the left hand side just above center.  Crop that off completely and only keep the top.  The soft pastel sky is nice and the silhouette of the structure is ice.  But the water on beach and such is not.</td>', 'I was going to say this is a nice clear image then I saw the red/blue noise in the sand and on the rock followed by the yellow noise in the water.  For me its a bit distracting.  I would say to make this less distracting crop it off just above the stone/rock/formation on the left hand side just above center.  Crop that off completely and only keep the top.  The soft pastel sky is nice and the silhouette of the structure is ice.  But the water on beach and such is not.', '2010-01-05 18:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797453, 842406, 16197, '<td valign="top">The sun''s brightness completely blows out any detail that would give this piece interest.  There really is not anything here that I can say about it.  The outline''s appear to be in focus but could be misleading because of the smoke/smog/cloud/haze or whatever is there.</td>', 'The sun''s brightness completely blows out any detail that would give this piece interest.  There really is not anything here that I can say about it.  The outline''s appear to be in focus but could be misleading because of the smoke/smog/cloud/haze or whatever is there.', '2010-01-05 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797455, 841950, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.  It takes a few moments to really stare at this image to identify what it is.  It is easy to confuse the figure on the right to be a primate of sorts because the coat moves around the chin in a way that could be a mouth.  For me however it is an ok image.  The clarity and lighting are much better on the figure on the left.  But in the same basket I am assuming that this was at the zoo and through glass so not much control over lighting of the figure on the right.</td>', 'Interesting capture.  It takes a few moments to really stare at this image to identify what it is.  It is easy to confuse the figure on the right to be a primate of sorts because the coat moves around the chin in a way that could be a mouth.  For me however it is an ok image.  The clarity and lighting are much better on the figure on the left.  But in the same basket I am assuming that this was at the zoo and through glass so not much control over lighting of the figure on the right.', '2010-01-05 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797456, 843309, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very cute family portrait.  Though all of the skin appears overly smoothed with strange reflections in the eyes that kinda creep me out.  Like I said though, it is cute, but for me it just does not wow me.  I would hope for something more.</td>', 'Very cute family portrait.  Though all of the skin appears overly smoothed with strange reflections in the eyes that kinda creep me out.  Like I said though, it is cute, but for me it just does not wow me.  I would hope for something more.', '2010-01-05 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797457, 842314, 16197, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro though the flower appears very strange looking.  Almost plastic but very fake.  The critter is interesting I just wish he was facing the other direction and gave us something more interesting to look at then a boring brown exoskeleton.</td>', 'Lovely macro though the flower appears very strange looking.  Almost plastic but very fake.  The critter is interesting I just wish he was facing the other direction and gave us something more interesting to look at then a boring brown exoskeleton.', '2010-01-05 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797458, 843314, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape.  I personally do not much care for the processing.  It appears a bit blurred to me around the trees.  The sky although has potential appears forgotten and the depth is not there.  Overall it is ok, but simply does not wow me.</td>', 'Interesting landscape.  I personally do not much care for the processing.  It appears a bit blurred to me around the trees.  The sky although has potential appears forgotten and the depth is not there.  Overall it is ok, but simply does not wow me.', '2010-01-05 18:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
