(5797500, 842613, 36102, '<td valign="top">haha, before I scrolled down to see your title I said to myself, "what? Is that an otter in a tree?"  Good framing around the otter''s face with the little flowers.  Very interesting picture.</td>', 'haha, before I scrolled down to see your title I said to myself, "what? Is that an otter in a tree?"  Good framing around the otter''s face with the little flowers.  Very interesting picture.', '2010-01-05 19:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797501, 843230, 36102, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is great.  Perfect little mountain of green coming up into the frame, silly little pose from the bird. Excellent focus, nice blurred out background.  I might have cropped off the left side just a tiny bit, the brown is a little distracting but that''s just being very nitpicky.</td>', 'Wow!  This is great.  Perfect little mountain of green coming up into the frame, silly little pose from the bird. Excellent focus, nice blurred out background.  I might have cropped off the left side just a tiny bit, the brown is a little distracting but that''s just being very nitpicky.', '2010-01-05 19:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797521, 840994, 113427, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photo are great. I absolutely love the variety of colors the on the rock.</td>', 'The colors in this photo are great. I absolutely love the variety of colors the on the rock.', '2010-01-05 19:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797537, 838635, 16197, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I have been looking at this image for a while now and I am not quite sure.  Perhaps for me it is a bit dark on the shadow side and I am wanting something more to pop for me with all those wonderful textures.  Perhaps I am wanting something more in the sky, it seems a bit bland as compared to the rest.  I do enjoy the reflection of orange going between those croppings just not in the center of the image.</td>', 'Hmm, I have been looking at this image for a while now and I am not quite sure.  Perhaps for me it is a bit dark on the shadow side and I am wanting something more to pop for me with all those wonderful textures.  Perhaps I am wanting something more in the sky, it seems a bit bland as compared to the rest.  I do enjoy the reflection of orange going between those croppings just not in the center of the image.', '2010-01-05 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797538, 841625, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea.  Though for me, it just does not look right, and there is a strange cloud or smudge in the sky.  It is a bit distracting.  So the water appears more smooth then it should I am guessing because of the length of exposure.  It makes the bridge appear a bit blurred.  On the far side the buildings look more in focus but they are part of the background so my eyes are conflicted.</td>', 'This is a nice idea.  Though for me, it just does not look right, and there is a strange cloud or smudge in the sky.  It is a bit distracting.  So the water appears more smooth then it should I am guessing because of the length of exposure.  It makes the bridge appear a bit blurred.  On the far side the buildings look more in focus but they are part of the background so my eyes are conflicted.', '2010-01-05 19:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797541, 842601, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid image.  The colours work well.  The blacks could be pushed just a bit more on parts of the trees.  I would hope the people were a bit more in focus to create stronger clarity.  But overall it is a nice image, just a bit disconnected for me.</td>', 'Nice vivid image.  The colours work well.  The blacks could be pushed just a bit more on parts of the trees.  I would hope the people were a bit more in focus to create stronger clarity.  But overall it is a nice image, just a bit disconnected for me.', '2010-01-05 19:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797542, 840791, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot, but for me, if I am looking at a drummer I want to be looking at a DRUMMER!  Banging his sticks down so hard they may snap at any moment.  Moving to the beat, the emotion in the face.  I want something hard core.  Yet for me, its just some guy in a quilt holding some sticks.  At first look I questioned if he was cleaning his ears.  Its a nice snapshot and a good memory for you but for me, it is not.</td>', 'Nice snapshot, but for me, if I am looking at a drummer I want to be looking at a DRUMMER!  Banging his sticks down so hard they may snap at any moment.  Moving to the beat, the emotion in the face.  I want something hard core.  Yet for me, its just some guy in a quilt holding some sticks.  At first look I questioned if he was cleaning his ears.  Its a nice snapshot and a good memory for you but for me, it is not.', '2010-01-05 19:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797545, 842952, 16197, '<td valign="top">The dof is way to far back, I see the background in focus but not the two horses.  There is so much texture and personality and character possible within this image I just wish it was brought out a bit stronger.</td>', 'The dof is way to far back, I see the background in focus but not the two horses.  There is so much texture and personality and character possible within this image I just wish it was brought out a bit stronger.', '2010-01-05 19:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797547, 842635, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly nice image.  The contrasts of the trees and snow works fairly well in the branches.  However the pagoda/steamroom or whatever it is feels completely out of place it does not connect to me strong as I would have liked.  Also there is a odd angle towards the foreground ground that gives me a varied feel of perspective.</td>', 'This is a fairly nice image.  The contrasts of the trees and snow works fairly well in the branches.  However the pagoda/steamroom or whatever it is feels completely out of place it does not connect to me strong as I would have liked.  Also there is a odd angle towards the foreground ground that gives me a varied feel of perspective.', '2010-01-05 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797549, 841733, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait, the selective saturation is something I have done several times with my own self-portraits.  However for me here it feels as if the whites may have been pushed a tad too far and are blown.  Or maybe my monitor is overly bright.  It is simple, its cute.  But for me it just is not very poppy.  No real wow factor for me.</td>', 'Cute portrait, the selective saturation is something I have done several times with my own self-portraits.  However for me here it feels as if the whites may have been pushed a tad too far and are blown.  Or maybe my monitor is overly bright.  It is simple, its cute.  But for me it just is not very poppy.  No real wow factor for me.', '2010-01-05 19:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797552, 839947, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting snapshot.  The darkened foreground gives an ominous feel as if she walks down this way bad things would happen.  However overall it feels more like a snapshot then anything.  It really does not give me a morning walk feel.</td>', 'Interesting snapshot.  The darkened foreground gives an ominous feel as if she walks down this way bad things would happen.  However overall it feels more like a snapshot then anything.  It really does not give me a morning walk feel.', '2010-01-05 19:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797611, 843306, 44877, '<td valign="top">The elements of this image are wonderful - the shoe, the hand, the smiling mouth, the cigarette, the big lashes, the night club lighting. I''m imagining it will get slammed, but I love it.</td>', 'The elements of this image are wonderful - the shoe, the hand, the smiling mouth, the cigarette, the big lashes, the night club lighting. I''m imagining it will get slammed, but I love it.', '2010-01-05 20:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797624, 841889, 16197, '<td valign="top">He is very clear and strong in this image. She seems less strong an a bit hidden.  Could be the fact that so much of him is seen to the little bit of her.  Its a cute lovely image, but it also looks like she is looking at the brim of his hate.  Barely able to skim the eyes.  The background is nice, it looks good, and the separation is nice.  Just for me it does not have a strong wow factor.  Anyone outside their friends and family i do not think will hold this image as high.</td>', 'He is very clear and strong in this image. She seems less strong an a bit hidden.  Could be the fact that so much of him is seen to the little bit of her.  Its a cute lovely image, but it also looks like she is looking at the brim of his hate.  Barely able to skim the eyes.  The background is nice, it looks good, and the separation is nice.  Just for me it does not have a strong wow factor.  Anyone outside their friends and family i do not think will hold this image as high.', '2010-01-05 20:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797629, 841789, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice candid portrait.  The clarity is nice and the background breaks off lovely.  Maybe a bit sharp seeing on how his right side is blurred but still kinda works.  The colours are nice and natural.  However if he is out playing in the snow I would have much rather seen a nice dramatic action shot with this colour and clarity then a simple portrait.  However it is still nice.</td>', 'Nice candid portrait.  The clarity is nice and the background breaks off lovely.  Maybe a bit sharp seeing on how his right side is blurred but still kinda works.  The colours are nice and natural.  However if he is out playing in the snow I would have much rather seen a nice dramatic action shot with this colour and clarity then a simple portrait.  However it is still nice.', '2010-01-05 20:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797636, 840658, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice find of lights.  However for me it seems very busy and bare.  There is too much white-space in my opinion which makes the image bare, but busy because the lights are only against the single plane.  I believe if you concentrated your shot to a more narrow and specific element it would have been much stronger overall.</td>', 'Nice find of lights.  However for me it seems very busy and bare.  There is too much white-space in my opinion which makes the image bare, but busy because the lights are only against the single plane.  I believe if you concentrated your shot to a more narrow and specific element it would have been much stronger overall.', '2010-01-05 20:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797642, 842890, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fun find.  However the black/white treatment does it no justice.  For me I want to see the bright and fading oranges of the pumpkins.  Because we could look at this and not all identify they are pumpkins.  If there was colour here and less noise I think this could be a funner image.  But overall does not really have a lot of interest.</td>', 'This is a fun find.  However the black/white treatment does it no justice.  For me I want to see the bright and fading oranges of the pumpkins.  Because we could look at this and not all identify they are pumpkins.  If there was colour here and less noise I think this could be a funner image.  But overall does not really have a lot of interest.', '2010-01-05 20:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797647, 841444, 16197, '<td valign="top">Lovely cute portrait.  I am positive the parents are ecstatic over it. However for me, it just doesn''t do it.  it is a common style and offers me no added interest.  The clarity and focal range is nice but I feel could be moved forward more.  It is almost lost on the far side which we barely see.  The tonal quality is nice but perhaps could be pushed a bit more.</td>', 'Lovely cute portrait.  I am positive the parents are ecstatic over it. However for me, it just doesn''t do it.  it is a common style and offers me no added interest.  The clarity and focal range is nice but I feel could be moved forward more.  It is almost lost on the far side which we barely see.  The tonal quality is nice but perhaps could be pushed a bit more.', '2010-01-05 20:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797650, 840255, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy how dark the buildings are in this skyline.  Though I would liked to have seen something a bit more vivid and dramatic with the colour of the sky and clouds.  Also for me the foreground holds no interest and in my opinion no added value, it may even take way from the actual skyline.</td>', 'I enjoy how dark the buildings are in this skyline.  Though I would liked to have seen something a bit more vivid and dramatic with the colour of the sky and clouds.  Also for me the foreground holds no interest and in my opinion no added value, it may even take way from the actual skyline.', '2010-01-05 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797665, 842927, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice clean portrait.  Sly little smile.  Though center composition distracts me as does the minimal separation between hair and background.  It is nice, but for me it just is not fantastic. With so many portraits in this challenge there needs to be something extra special.</td>', 'Nice clean portrait.  Sly little smile.  Though center composition distracts me as does the minimal separation between hair and background.  It is nice, but for me it just is not fantastic. With so many portraits in this challenge there needs to be something extra special.', '2010-01-05 20:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797671, 841217, 16197, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this concept.  However I am curious as to why so much white-space at the bottom of the image?  With less white-space and a stronger compositional organization of crop this could be a really fantastic image. I do enjoy the concept and the black/white treatment works well.</td>', 'I enjoy this concept.  However I am curious as to why so much white-space at the bottom of the image?  With less white-space and a stronger compositional organization of crop this could be a really fantastic image. I do enjoy the concept and the black/white treatment works well.', '2010-01-05 20:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797678, 840158, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute little bugger eating a snack.  For me though it appears a bit flat and the focal range distracts me with the clarity along the top of the head to the painted-like feel on the body.  The separation is nice along the paws, but no so much along the rest.</td>', 'Cute little bugger eating a snack.  For me though it appears a bit flat and the focal range distracts me with the clarity along the top of the head to the painted-like feel on the body.  The separation is nice along the paws, but no so much along the rest.', '2010-01-05 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797684, 841740, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Though for me there is something missing. Her skin appears plastic, overly smoothed and for me is a bit bright on her hand against the darks of the image.  It is fun, creative but just not enough for me.</td>', 'Nice concept.  Though for me there is something missing. Her skin appears plastic, overly smoothed and for me is a bit bright on her hand against the darks of the image.  It is fun, creative but just not enough for me.', '2010-01-05 20:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5797685, 840538, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot.  Though the tonal quality appears a bit flat and does not really pop for me.  Specially with the selective focus used to blur out the rest of the image.  Overall it is cute for the owners but not for me.</td>', 'Cute snapshot.  Though the tonal quality appears a bit flat and does not really pop for me.  Specially with the selective focus used to blur out the rest of the image.  Overall it is cute for the owners but not for me.', '2010-01-05 20:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
