(5797691, 841042, 16197, '<td valign="top">I was looking at this earlier.  It really does not make any sense to me.  Also I feel that with so much visible it make be taking away from the actual image.  The colours and clarity are nice but it just does not give me anything of interest.  I have a complete disconnect to the image.</td>', 'I was looking at this earlier.  It really does not make any sense to me.  Also I feel that with so much visible it make be taking away from the actual image.  The colours and clarity are nice but it just does not give me anything of interest.  I have a complete disconnect to the image.', '2010-01-05 20:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
