(5797940, 842589, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the better duck shots I''ve seen. Getting low in the grass was just the thing. If you got cold and wet, the shot was worth it.</td>', 'One of the better duck shots I''ve seen. Getting low in the grass was just the thing. If you got cold and wet, the shot was worth it.', '2010-01-05 23:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
