(5798939, 842993, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: Beautiful lighting here and the colours too are tremendous. This has an understated quality which I really like.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: It may be a little quirky for some viewers who may balk at its faux-portrait-ness.<br/> <br/>Overall: I really like it.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: Beautiful lighting here and the colours too are tremendous. This has an understated quality which I really like. Critical stuff: It may be a little quirky for some viewers who may balk at its faux-portrait-ness. Overall: I really like it.', '2010-01-06 11:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
