(5799399, 842319, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the angular composition here and the overall clarity of the image. Brave to present neon in monochrome but I think your image is strong enough to carry it.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not too much really - I think I''d rather see the neon in colour but then that isn''t what this image is about.<br/> <br/>Overall: Well executed building study.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: I really like the angular composition here and the overall clarity of the image. Brave to present neon in monochrome but I think your image is strong enough to carry it. Critical stuff: Not too much really - I think I''d rather see the neon in colour but then that isn''t what this image is about. Overall: Well executed building study.', '2010-01-06 17:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
