(5799425, 843317, 100393, '<td valign="top">OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award: <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like the composition here - it feels well-balanced. Looks a little tone mapped but that works too. The roots make for an interesting element of the image.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: For me the image lacks depth (because the scene does), but coupled with the flat light and the edit - it is quite flat.<br/> <br/>Overall: An interest choice of image and certainly worth offering up.</td>', 'OK, I''m going through the Free Study submissions, purposefully finding those images I think are shot with a less conventional eye - this is one of those images! Thanks for offering something that isn''t just DPC friendly eye-candy (though of course there''s nothing wrong with eye-candy). I''ll be picking one of these images for the Mu (most underrated) award:  Positives: I really like the composition here - it feels well-balanced. Looks a little tone mapped but that works too. The roots make for an interesting element of the image. Critical stuff: For me the image lacks depth (because the scene does), but coupled with the flat light and the edit - it is quite flat. Overall: An interest choice of image and certainly worth offering up.', '2010-01-06 17:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799496, 839478, 113429, '<td valign="top">this is totally awesome!</td>', 'this is totally awesome!', '2010-01-06 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
