(5799834, 842244, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of the really light cirrus clouds and the dying light. Your entry sets itself apart from the other beach+sunset+pier shots by being given a softer touch in processing (which I like).</td>', 'I''m a big fan of the really light cirrus clouds and the dying light. Your entry sets itself apart from the other beach+sunset+pier shots by being given a softer touch in processing (which I like).', '2010-01-06 22:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799837, 843280, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice, even lighting. Excellent use of DoF, and all around great portrait. It looks like your background ran out a bit top left, but that''s minor.</td>', 'Very nice, even lighting. Excellent use of DoF, and all around great portrait. It looks like your background ran out a bit top left, but that''s minor.', '2010-01-06 22:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799844, 841315, 93565, '<td valign="top">I haven''t a clue what I''m looking at... a metal Christmas tree from below, perhaps? Regardless, I like it. The lines (whatever they are) radiating out from the center in the background only add to the sci-fi feeling.</td>', 'I haven''t a clue what I''m looking at... a metal Christmas tree from below, perhaps? Regardless, I like it. The lines (whatever they are) radiating out from the center in the background only add to the sci-fi feeling.', '2010-01-06 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799849, 843231, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene. I especially like how a scale to the falls and icicles is created by the presence of the small building below. Good choice on the long shutter too.</td>', 'Very cool scene. I especially like how a scale to the falls and icicles is created by the presence of the small building below. Good choice on the long shutter too.', '2010-01-06 22:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799853, 843009, 93565, '<td valign="top">More DoF or a higher vantage point up above the grass would be preferable. As is, the grass forms a somewhat muddled mass, being out of focus and right up in the viewer''s face.</td>', 'More DoF or a higher vantage point up above the grass would be preferable. As is, the grass forms a somewhat muddled mass, being out of focus and right up in the viewer''s face.', '2010-01-06 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799861, 839829, 93565, '<td valign="top">It''s impossible for me to say how much of the effect is due to your editing and how much is due to the strange lighting conditions that fog can create, but this has a very painting-like look and feel to it. Especially the buildings. Looks like very interesting country.</td>', 'It''s impossible for me to say how much of the effect is due to your editing and how much is due to the strange lighting conditions that fog can create, but this has a very painting-like look and feel to it. Especially the buildings. Looks like very interesting country.', '2010-01-06 22:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799869, 840502, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great simplicity. I love how smooth windblown snow can get.</td>', 'Great simplicity. I love how smooth windblown snow can get.', '2010-01-06 22:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799875, 841037, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m not personally a fan of the blur on the foliage.</td>', 'I''m not personally a fan of the blur on the foliage.', '2010-01-06 22:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799877, 841842, 93565, '<td valign="top">Though I''d expect a little bit more detail in the foreground rocks, this is a great sunset photo. Colors are not out of control, and the sky has a pleasing dreamscape essence.</td>', 'Though I''d expect a little bit more detail in the foreground rocks, this is a great sunset photo. Colors are not out of control, and the sky has a pleasing dreamscape essence.', '2010-01-06 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799882, 842989, 93565, '<td valign="top">A bit soft throughout. Perhaps try lowering ISO, as this appears to have some grain about it. A BW conversion might be interesting, as well.</td>', 'A bit soft throughout. Perhaps try lowering ISO, as this appears to have some grain about it. A BW conversion might be interesting, as well.', '2010-01-06 22:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799913, 843300, 29156, '<td valign="top">falleg mynd</td>', 'falleg mynd', '2010-01-06 23:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
