(5799915, 842928, 56579, '<td valign="top">needs to be bigger</td>', 'needs to be bigger', '2010-01-06 23:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799916, 843274, 56579, '<td valign="top">OOF, not interesting, and not abstract</td>', 'OOF, not interesting, and not abstract', '2010-01-06 23:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799924, 843023, 93565, '<td valign="top">Scene is well exposed and the title is very fitting. I can imagine how quiet things would be if it weren''t for the wind. I like the image; undecided about the vignette.</td>', 'Scene is well exposed and the title is very fitting. I can imagine how quiet things would be if it weren''t for the wind. I like the image; undecided about the vignette.', '2010-01-06 23:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799926, 840997, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cool building. The cloudless and featureless sky is a nice to see in a seaside setting. I had to look up what a Dhow was, but I''m glad I did. Nice find.</td>', 'Cool building. The cloudless and featureless sky is a nice to see in a seaside setting. I had to look up what a Dhow was, but I''m glad I did. Nice find.', '2010-01-06 23:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799928, 843107, 93565, '<td valign="top">Pfff. You must not have ever taken a polar bear plunge. Or maybe you''re just not a masochist.<br/>Either way, I like the steam coming up off the water, and the smooth, snow covered rocks serve as a nice contrast to the turbulent waters that surround them.</td>', 'Pfff. You must not have ever taken a polar bear plunge. Or maybe you''re just not a masochist.Either way, I like the steam coming up off the water, and the smooth, snow covered rocks serve as a nice contrast to the turbulent waters that surround them.', '2010-01-06 23:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799929, 843301, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like how you have used lions not only in the foreground, but also in the background as compared to just the typical lion face shot.</td>', 'I like how you have used lions not only in the foreground, but also in the background as compared to just the typical lion face shot.', '2010-01-06 23:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799930, 842990, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer the sky weren''t blown, but I find this shot interesting. It makes me think of some post apocalypse scene- the lack of fences and any hinting of human presence interests me.</td>', 'I''d prefer the sky weren''t blown, but I find this shot interesting. It makes me think of some post apocalypse scene- the lack of fences and any hinting of human presence interests me.', '2010-01-06 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799931, 843168, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m sure if you had asked nicely, the fox would have turned to face you and moved to an area that wasn''t quite so cluttered with vegetation, being that foxes are such obedient subjects for photography.</td>', 'I''m sure if you had asked nicely, the fox would have turned to face you and moved to an area that wasn''t quite so cluttered with vegetation, being that foxes are such obedient subjects for photography.', '2010-01-06 23:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799932, 841855, 93565, '<td valign="top">I appreciate that you''ve included some motion in your silhouette. It seems that the vast majority of shots like these are static, and the opposing movement is interesting, especially with the group of two deeper into the scene. It pulls the viewer from the right and then towards the ocean and the sun.</td>', 'I appreciate that you''ve included some motion in your silhouette. It seems that the vast majority of shots like these are static, and the opposing movement is interesting, especially with the group of two deeper into the scene. It pulls the viewer from the right and then towards the ocean and the sun.', '2010-01-06 23:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799935, 842241, 93565, '<td valign="top">Cute title, but I have a feeling you''re getting hammered by the voters. Whites are overexposed.</td>', 'Cute title, but I have a feeling you''re getting hammered by the voters. Whites are overexposed.', '2010-01-06 23:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799955, 843231, 24486, '<td valign="top">I really like the effect. Even the falling water looks frozen.</td>', 'I really like the effect. Even the falling water looks frozen.', '2010-01-07 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799970, 841042, 93565, '<td valign="top">Interesting placement of the bulbs. I''m not following the modern rituals aspect, but you''ve captured the incense smoke nicely.</td>', 'Interesting placement of the bulbs. I''m not following the modern rituals aspect, but you''ve captured the incense smoke nicely.', '2010-01-07 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799974, 841625, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think this could be cool, but the purple lights are just garishly bright to me.</td>', 'I think this could be cool, but the purple lights are just garishly bright to me.', '2010-01-07 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799977, 840994, 93565, '<td valign="top">The rocks add a bit more interest to this shot, but FS are notoriously plagued by seascape shots, and you really need to do a lot to separate yourself from the field. As a photograph, I like it though.</td>', 'The rocks add a bit more interest to this shot, but FS are notoriously plagued by seascape shots, and you really need to do a lot to separate yourself from the field. As a photograph, I like it though.', '2010-01-07 00:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799979, 843254, 24486, '<td valign="top">Definetly one of the best water skiing photographs I have seen. Just brilliant.</td>', 'Definetly one of the best water skiing photographs I have seen. Just brilliant.', '2010-01-07 00:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5799993, 843211, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the dodging, and the steam/smoke/mist/dust or whatever it is rising from behind the tree really adds to things. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the dodging, and the steam/smoke/mist/dust or whatever it is rising from behind the tree really adds to things. Nice shot.', '2010-01-07 00:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800001, 838090, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome portrait. Nice color in the clothing, skin tones are great, nice posing. Burning the background was nice too.<br/>There''s a really weird reflection in her left eye though.<br/>On a side note, there''s something about how she''s posed that makes it look like she''s lying down, but that''s just a general aside.</td>', 'This is an awesome portrait. Nice color in the clothing, skin tones are great, nice posing. Burning the background was nice too.There''s a really weird reflection in her left eye though.On a side note, there''s something about how she''s posed that makes it look like she''s lying down, but that''s just a general aside.', '2010-01-07 01:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800008, 839947, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like how she seems to just be standing in the midst of the road, frozen.</td>', 'I like how she seems to just be standing in the midst of the road, frozen.', '2010-01-07 01:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800009, 843106, 93565, '<td valign="top">You managed to perfectly capture stillness with this one. Nice shot.</td>', 'You managed to perfectly capture stillness with this one. Nice shot.', '2010-01-07 01:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800011, 842943, 95065, '<td valign="top">Might consider cropping top and bottom more.  Interesting image.</td>', 'Might consider cropping top and bottom more.  Interesting image.', '2010-01-07 01:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800012, 841548, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think DoF should have either been increased or decreased. As is, the flowers aren''t uniformly focused but still demand a lot of attention. The greenery leads me down to the left corner, and is then cut off, as well.</td>', 'I think DoF should have either been increased or decreased. As is, the flowers aren''t uniformly focused but still demand a lot of attention. The greenery leads me down to the left corner, and is then cut off, as well.', '2010-01-07 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800014, 841561, 95065, '<td valign="top">the matching eyes really help make this shot!  Did you have any where the cat was looking at the camera too?</td>', 'the matching eyes really help make this shot!  Did you have any where the cat was looking at the camera too?', '2010-01-07 01:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800024, 841680, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I certainly hope you got something into the Blue Moon challenge. Interesting foliage, and a great job exposing for the moon as well. Border is a little dominating.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I certainly hope you got something into the Blue Moon challenge. Interesting foliage, and a great job exposing for the moon as well. Border is a little dominating.', '2010-01-07 01:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800025, 842943, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the main road be concentrated on more in regards to composition. It demands your attention, but a lot of the scene is composed of static buildings.</td>', 'I''d like to see the main road be concentrated on more in regards to composition. It demands your attention, but a lot of the scene is composed of static buildings.', '2010-01-07 01:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800029, 842204, 93565, '<td valign="top">Lightning shots are hard to get. Stopping down a bit more would help eliminate that haze you''ve got going on (unless of course the haze is from multiple strikes, in which case you''d have to close your shutter earlier, and before multiple strikes occur). Of course, the more unobstructed the view the better.</td>', 'Lightning shots are hard to get. Stopping down a bit more would help eliminate that haze you''ve got going on (unless of course the haze is from multiple strikes, in which case you''d have to close your shutter earlier, and before multiple strikes occur). Of course, the more unobstructed the view the better.', '2010-01-07 01:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800031, 839717, 93565, '<td valign="top">You might consider framing things so that the giant pile of salt isn''t so prominent. Because the stream leads back up towards the terminus of the falls, it brings the viewer towards it, which isn''t good because brings additional attention to the overexposed area of the photo.</td>', 'You might consider framing things so that the giant pile of salt isn''t so prominent. Because the stream leads back up towards the terminus of the falls, it brings the viewer towards it, which isn''t good because brings additional attention to the overexposed area of the photo.', '2010-01-07 01:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800032, 842940, 93565, '<td valign="top">The rocks here are quite interesting, but perhaps not so interesting as the lighting. The way the rocks are so perfectly illuminated makes it appear as though they are cut and pasted into the scene, which is rather dreary. Neat effect.</td>', 'The rocks here are quite interesting, but perhaps not so interesting as the lighting. The way the rocks are so perfectly illuminated makes it appear as though they are cut and pasted into the scene, which is rather dreary. Neat effect.', '2010-01-07 01:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800033, 841754, 93565, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of a vignette. I like this quite a bit. Good job.</td>', 'Very effective use of a vignette. I like this quite a bit. Good job.', '2010-01-07 01:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800034, 843296, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m really liking how perfectly flawless the reflection is.</td>', 'I''m really liking how perfectly flawless the reflection is.', '2010-01-07 01:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800036, 842991, 93565, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of leading lines to emphasize the magnitude of the scene. It really makes the viewer feel insignificant to what is happening.</td>', 'Excellent use of leading lines to emphasize the magnitude of the scene. It really makes the viewer feel insignificant to what is happening.', '2010-01-07 01:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800072, 841313, 93565, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the way the city stretches off into the distance, and the lighting on the mountainside is interesting too. Cool photo.</td>', 'I really enjoy the way the city stretches off into the distance, and the lighting on the mountainside is interesting too. Cool photo.', '2010-01-07 02:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5800080, 840383, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''ll take a wild guess that this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=7467" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Drake</a>?</td>', 'I''ll take a wild guess that this is  Drake?', '2010-01-07 03:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
