(5801246, 841865, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this but probably not in the manner you intended. The lighting is harsh and unflattering, the crop is severe, and the red duotone is a tad macabre. In a way, it''s kind of creepy. <br/> <br/>I''m scoring it relatively high (a seven) because I like it for its (sorry!) shock value. I hope you won''t take offense. I''m sure she is an angel, but this isn''t the best showing of it. Maybe the title was meant to be ironic...</td>', 'I like this but probably not in the manner you intended. The lighting is harsh and unflattering, the crop is severe, and the red duotone is a tad macabre. In a way, it''s kind of creepy.  I''m scoring it relatively high (a seven) because I like it for its (sorry!) shock value. I hope you won''t take offense. I''m sure she is an angel, but this isn''t the best showing of it. Maybe the title was meant to be ironic...', '2010-01-07 21:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
