(5801447, 843300, 61961, '<td valign="top">One of my challenge favorites, without reservation.  Lovely use of what presumably could have been a dreary backdrop.  Technically fine photography, but it''s your <i>ultra-gamine</i> model who really makes the photo fly.</td>', 'One of my challenge favorites, without reservation.  Lovely use of what presumably could have been a dreary backdrop.  Technically fine photography, but it''s your ultra-gamine model who really makes the photo fly.', '2010-01-07 22:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
