(5801470, 841051, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of a (presumably) "found" scene and excellent work on the part of the photographer.</td>', 'Nice combination of a (presumably) "found" scene and excellent work on the part of the photographer.', '2010-01-07 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5801478, 841748, 61961, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo; I''m somewhat uninterested in the subject (another super-sharp lion portrait), but I can''t deny the talent on display here.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo; I''m somewhat uninterested in the subject (another super-sharp lion portrait), but I can''t deny the talent on display here.', '2010-01-07 22:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5801480, 843350, 61961, '<td valign="top">A bit over-exposed perhaps but has a good candid feel and nice treatment.  This guy''s handsome, worn face is fantastic.</td>', 'A bit over-exposed perhaps but has a good candid feel and nice treatment.  This guy''s handsome, worn face is fantastic.', '2010-01-07 22:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5801482, 841628, 86218, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. Im not going to even try and analyze what I feel work and does not work but its just one of those photos that pulls you in. No doubt horsey on left has a lot to do with it but the whole scene works so well. Very good capture. 8 <br/>Bump this up to a 9 for sure</td>', 'I absolutely love this. Im not going to even try and analyze what I feel work and does not work but its just one of those photos that pulls you in. No doubt horsey on left has a lot to do with it but the whole scene works so well. Very good capture. 8 Bump this up to a 9 for sure', '2010-01-07 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5801483, 843174, 61961, '<td valign="top">Really stands out for me as a unique entry.</td>', 'Really stands out for me as a unique entry.', '2010-01-07 22:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
