(5802063, 842854, 24666, '<td valign="top">in reply to one of the comments the definition of Vamp = A woman who uses her sex appeal to entrap and exploit men.<br/> <br/>In British English and traditional American English usage, a tramp is a long term homeless person who travels from place to place as an itinerant vagrant, traditionally walking or hiking all year round.<br/> <br/>I assume the version of tramp that you talk about is the following , swinger: a person who engages freely in promiscuous sex , now why would you think that , wishful thinking ?</td>', 'in reply to one of the comments the definition of Vamp = A woman who uses her sex appeal to entrap and exploit men. In British English and traditional American English usage, a tramp is a long term homeless person who travels from place to place as an itinerant vagrant, traditionally walking or hiking all year round. I assume the version of tramp that you talk about is the following , swinger: a person who engages freely in promiscuous sex , now why would you think that , wishful thinking ?', '2010-01-08 05:15:15.000000', NULL, 0);
