(5802082, 843201, 31456, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by littlegett:</b></div><hr/><i> No idea what the concept of this is.  No idea what the title says much less means.  All I see is an upside down image, from my perspective.  That being said, I don''t think this really is anything.  For me it does not say anything do anything and makes no sense.  I would pass by this every day and never notice it once. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>That''s a positive comment, right? Everything you wrote there, except for "all I see is an upside down image," is positive to me in this case. The fact that it doesn''t smack you over the face with an obvious meaning, the fact that it doesn''t really look like anything but is in fact something, the fact that the photographer has shown us something we''d never notice otherwise...<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=7778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">zeuszen</a>: Great concept, great shot. So, what is it?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-08 06:09:33.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by littlegett: No idea what the concept of this is.  No idea what the title says much less means.  All I see is an upside down image, from my perspective.  That being said, I don''t think this really is anything.  For me it does not say anything do anything and makes no sense.  I would pass by this every day and never notice it once.  That''s a positive comment, right? Everything you wrote there, except for "all I see is an upside down image," is positive to me in this case. The fact that it doesn''t smack you over the face with an obvious meaning, the fact that it doesn''t really look like anything but is in fact something, the fact that the photographer has shown us something we''d never notice otherwise...  zeuszen: Great concept, great shot. So, what is it?', '2010-01-08 06:08:45.000000', '2010-01-08 06:09:33.000000', 0),
