(5802119, 840791, 23484, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by littlegett:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice snapshot, but for me, if I am looking at a drummer I want to be looking at a DRUMMER!  Banging his sticks down so hard they may snap at any moment.  Moving to the beat, the emotion in the face.  I want something hard core.  Yet for me, its just some guy in a quilt holding some sticks.  At first look I questioned if he was cleaning his ears.  Its a nice snapshot and a good memory for you but for me, it is not. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry I upset you so much with my image. I''ll try to keep your wishes in mind the next time I enter a snhot.</td>', 'Originally posted by littlegett: Nice snapshot, but for me, if I am looking at a drummer I want to be looking at a DRUMMER!  Banging his sticks down so hard they may snap at any moment.  Moving to the beat, the emotion in the face.  I want something hard core.  Yet for me, its just some guy in a quilt holding some sticks.  At first look I questioned if he was cleaning his ears.  Its a nice snapshot and a good memory for you but for me, it is not.   Sorry I upset you so much with my image. I''ll try to keep your wishes in mind the next time I enter a snhot.', '2010-01-08 07:13:59.000000', NULL, 0),
