(5802160, 843246, 5034, '<td valign="top">It really just doesn''t grab me.  The building doesnt stand out, the sky colour is nice but the blue clouds detract from it a lot, it''s really just an average picture.  That being said you have absolutely NOTHING to complain about if 5.1 is your second lowest score.  This shot''s score is higher than my average vote received.</td>', 'It really just doesn''t grab me.  The building doesnt stand out, the sky colour is nice but the blue clouds detract from it a lot, it''s really just an average picture.  That being said you have absolutely NOTHING to complain about if 5.1 is your second lowest score.  This shot''s score is higher than my average vote received.', '2010-01-08 08:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5802167, 842203, 39184, '<td valign="top">Wow, Gennaro.  You''ve really come a long way over the years and are mastering many aspects of photography and post processing.  Very nice image.  I love your use of the fisheye lens and the not too over the top use of Topaz.  Congratulations on placing so high in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow, Gennaro.  You''ve really come a long way over the years and are mastering many aspects of photography and post processing.  Very nice image.  I love your use of the fisheye lens and the not too over the top use of Topaz.  Congratulations on placing so high in this challenge.', '2010-01-08 08:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
