(5802181, 839636, 27608, '<td valign="top">Rockin!  What a nice surprise to come into work to see a new PB, and a top 25 placing!  Thanks everyone for the wonderful comments!  Brad, anytime you want to shoot from the top of my building, just let me know :)<br/> <br/>Eric, I would suggest we wait till the summer months for a party :)  It''s cold up there, and extra windy to boot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-08 08:38:40.</i></td>', 'Rockin!  What a nice surprise to come into work to see a new PB, and a top 25 placing!  Thanks everyone for the wonderful comments!  Brad, anytime you want to shoot from the top of my building, just let me know :) Eric, I would suggest we wait till the summer months for a party :)  It''s cold up there, and extra windy to boot!', '2010-01-08 08:31:20.000000', '2010-01-08 08:38:40.000000', 0),
