(5802320, 843201, 35804, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by littlegett:</b></div><hr/><i> No idea what the concept of this is.  No idea what the title says much less means.  All I see is an upside down image, from my perspective.  That being said, I don''t think this really is anything.  For me it does not say anything do anything and makes no sense.  I would pass by this every day and never notice it once. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>...but you didn''t did you...pass it by.</td>', 'Originally posted by littlegett: No idea what the concept of this is.  No idea what the title says much less means.  All I see is an upside down image, from my perspective.  That being said, I don''t think this really is anything.  For me it does not say anything do anything and makes no sense.  I would pass by this every day and never notice it once.   ...but you didn''t did you...pass it by.', '2010-01-08 10:16:56.000000', NULL, 0),
