(5802337, 843201, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is so very interesting. Love the tones and the basic subject of no subject, but maybe the numbers are the subject. :) I love artsy and unfortunately, your shot fell the way of my artsy shots, lol. How very unfortunate. I''m faving this one!!</td>', 'This is so very interesting. Love the tones and the basic subject of no subject, but maybe the numbers are the subject. :) I love artsy and unfortunately, your shot fell the way of my artsy shots, lol. How very unfortunate. I''m faving this one!!', '2010-01-08 10:27:14.000000', NULL, 0),
