(5802800, 843094, 16197, '<td valign="top">In looking at this image, it really does capture you.  I might not call it vivid but the contrast of the warm skin framed within the dark warm hair and the cooler blue of the coat surrounded by the cooler background allows for her to stand out a bit more.  The eyes seem to have been over treated and have lost a bit of depth/shadow that creates contrast/shape.  Overall it is a nice image.  Yet it is just a portrait.  There could be a sharper clarity within the model as well as a stronger separation of background.  There is something I like about the background, the lines and such, yet it melds in with the fly-away hairs and creates a blurred feel on the viewer''s eyes.  Though come the end of the day she does capture attention.</td>', 'In looking at this image, it really does capture you.  I might not call it vivid but the contrast of the warm skin framed within the dark warm hair and the cooler blue of the coat surrounded by the cooler background allows for her to stand out a bit more.  The eyes seem to have been over treated and have lost a bit of depth/shadow that creates contrast/shape.  Overall it is a nice image.  Yet it is just a portrait.  There could be a sharper clarity within the model as well as a stronger separation of background.  There is something I like about the background, the lines and such, yet it melds in with the fly-away hairs and creates a blurred feel on the viewer''s eyes.  Though come the end of the day she does capture attention.', '2010-01-08 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5802808, 840218, 16197, '<td valign="top">The placing disappointment, though I have never been one to go with the masses L()L  This is a very enjoyable image, to bad others did not find its beauty in its simplicity.</td>', 'The placing disappointment, though I have never been one to go with the masses L()L  This is a very enjoyable image, to bad others did not find its beauty in its simplicity.', '2010-01-08 16:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5802818, 842925, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!! I love it! All the way home from minnesota, I kept seeing batches of trees in the snow. They were so lovely, I really wanted to photograph them. However, it was snowing, we were on icy freeways, and I figured it wouldn''t be a good idea to try to pull off on a shoulder with snowplows going by :D<br/> <br/>However, I wouldn''t have thought about trying a longer exposure. I love the shot and the effect. Thanks once again for helping me see past the ordinary!</td>', 'This is so cool!! I love it! All the way home from minnesota, I kept seeing batches of trees in the snow. They were so lovely, I really wanted to photograph them. However, it was snowing, we were on icy freeways, and I figured it wouldn''t be a good idea to try to pull off on a shoulder with snowplows going by :D However, I wouldn''t have thought about trying a longer exposure. I love the shot and the effect. Thanks once again for helping me see past the ordinary!', '2010-01-08 16:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5802824, 843137, 67697, '<td valign="top">Funny thing is that I did not even notice the cigarette when voting.  I gave this an 8 and I''m really surprised about the final score.  The lighting looks great and the detail you captured on your face is awesome.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Funny thing is that I did not even notice the cigarette when voting.  I gave this an 8 and I''m really surprised about the final score.  The lighting looks great and the detail you captured on your face is awesome.  Excellent shot.', '2010-01-08 16:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
