(5802865, 843231, 4493, '<td valign="top">To make more impact with this shot, try cropping the top off. Remove all the distractions at the top, and you''ll see that just having the one house at the bottom really pops and makes a world of difference in the composition.<br/> <br/>-danny<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-01-08 16:43:39.</i></td>', 'To make more impact with this shot, try cropping the top off. Remove all the distractions at the top, and you''ll see that just having the one house at the bottom really pops and makes a world of difference in the composition. -danny', '2010-01-08 16:42:43.000000', '2010-01-08 16:43:39.000000', 0),
