(5803082, 842207, 39184, '<td valign="top">I agree that this appears to be way over sharpened.  I disagree about converting it to B &amp; W.  I like all the blue and white with the contrasting red wheel.  I''d like to get my chainsaw in there and remove a lot of the branches, not most, but a lot of them as well as some of the trees.  But that''s probably not something that you can realistically do.  Yep, I would definitely like to see this reworked without as much sharpening.</td>', 'I agree that this appears to be way over sharpened.  I disagree about converting it to B & W.  I like all the blue and white with the contrasting red wheel.  I''d like to get my chainsaw in there and remove a lot of the branches, not most, but a lot of them as well as some of the trees.  But that''s probably not something that you can realistically do.  Yep, I would definitely like to see this reworked without as much sharpening.', '2010-01-08 20:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
