(5803378, 843234, 73142, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful light! I''m curious. Did you light this? Is it natural? You are either a master at lighting fleeting moments or a master at toning a photo! Just gorgeous!</td>', 'This is beautiful light! I''m curious. Did you light this? Is it natural? You are either a master at lighting fleeting moments or a master at toning a photo! Just gorgeous!', '2010-01-09 00:45:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5803409, 839829, 94815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful compressed layering and atmosphere.</td>', 'Beautiful compressed layering and atmosphere.', '2010-01-09 01:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5803410, 841444, 69008, '<td valign="top">Wowzers!   This is classic stuff Judy.  What impressive lighting and features.</td>', 'Wowzers!   This is classic stuff Judy.  What impressive lighting and features.', '2010-01-09 01:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5803448, 842946, 86218, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the very kind comments. I really appreciate and all credit goes to my patient wife who allows me to go on hikes. Soon she would have to join me however once my youngest of 4 are able to join in and carry his own backpack. Not long to go. Untill then my 7 and 10 year olds are doing an amazing job at rugging it out in nature and loving it as much as dad. My own dad at 69 I have new respect for since he did make this trip with us..as he has done so on countless of other occasions. He always puts up with my bad cooking and makes the food disappear somewhere over a cliff...(yes I know dad) Eating does not feature to highly on the priority list.<br/>Thanks once again to all. Best whishes for a great 2010. Soccer world cup in SA...what a year we are looking forward to. <br/>Botes family.</td>', 'Thank you all for the very kind comments. I really appreciate and all credit goes to my patient wife who allows me to go on hikes. Soon she would have to join me however once my youngest of 4 are able to join in and carry his own backpack. Not long to go. Untill then my 7 and 10 year olds are doing an amazing job at rugging it out in nature and loving it as much as dad. My own dad at 69 I have new respect for since he did make this trip with us..as he has done so on countless of other occasions. He always puts up with my bad cooking and makes the food disappear somewhere over a cliff...(yes I know dad) Eating does not feature to highly on the priority list.Thanks once again to all. Best whishes for a great 2010. Soccer world cup in SA...what a year we are looking forward to. Botes family.', '2010-01-09 02:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5803483, 838577, 44728, '<td valign="top">Thanks all :-)</td>', 'Thanks all :-)', '2010-01-09 05:03:30.000000', NULL, 0),
