(5803822, 842989, 68504, '<td valign="top">Great pop out at you expression - I wouldn''t say piercing, more as if Mandy and maybe you were making a little fun of this genre.  And by golly I think I like all the things about it that give one of your commenters such pause.  (Hmn.  I wonder if things are really OK if they do nothing...)</td>', 'Great pop out at you expression - I wouldn''t say piercing, more as if Mandy and maybe you were making a little fun of this genre.  And by golly I think I like all the things about it that give one of your commenters such pause.  (Hmn.  I wonder if things are really OK if they do nothing...)', '2010-01-09 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
