(5803872, 843246, 90414, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image, and certainly an interesting travelogue item. I see too much dead space, though. Just not enough interest in the water or sky to need that much space. Had I voted this FS, I would have scored it a 5. Free Study scores usually tend to be lower, so this would likely have finished 5.5 to 5.7 in a regular challenge.</td>', 'Not a bad image, and certainly an interesting travelogue item. I see too much dead space, though. Just not enough interest in the water or sky to need that much space. Had I voted this FS, I would have scored it a 5. Free Study scores usually tend to be lower, so this would likely have finished 5.5 to 5.7 in a regular challenge.', '2010-01-09 14:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5803935, 842319, 43088, '<td valign="top">I think the reason it places lower is lack of color to catch the eye. I shot it for the neon colors but decided it looked really cool in black an white- sort of a film noir look. Thanks for the encouraging comments!</td>', 'I think the reason it places lower is lack of color to catch the eye. I shot it for the neon colors but decided it looked really cool in black an white- sort of a film noir look. Thanks for the encouraging comments!', '2010-01-09 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5803980, 843301, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOVED the expressions in this - and your title was excellent!  Good tight crop, and good use of the square format for impact.  I''m very surprised it didn''t score higher, but I will say that is probably the highest commenter average I''ve ever seen for something that got more than five comments during a challenge.  That''s amazing!</td>', 'LOVED the expressions in this - and your title was excellent!  Good tight crop, and good use of the square format for impact.  I''m very surprised it didn''t score higher, but I will say that is probably the highest commenter average I''ve ever seen for something that got more than five comments during a challenge.  That''s amazing!', '2010-01-09 16:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
