(5804170, 841748, 54885, '<td valign="top">I am no photo expert, but to me.. this photo should not have been marked anything less than a 9. I marked this photo as a 10. The color was perfect, the framing and capture plus clarity was so wonderful. This is one of those photos that make me want to say "Thank You" for sharing a wonderful photo for me to look at.</td>', 'I am no photo expert, but to me.. this photo should not have been marked anything less than a 9. I marked this photo as a 10. The color was perfect, the framing and capture plus clarity was so wonderful. This is one of those photos that make me want to say "Thank You" for sharing a wonderful photo for me to look at.', '2010-01-09 19:24:34.000000', NULL, 0),
