(5834122, 843011, 103427, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting. It kinda looks like a photo of a picture though - maybe went too far on the processing? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Barely any destructive processing, actually. Just tweaked some delicate stuff and I did give it one texture. The hotel is unbelievable. Everyone, and I mean everyone gets lost here. Each turn of the corner is another look and feel of the hotel.<br/>And it would be very illegal for me to take a photo of a photo, wouldn''t it. Not to speak of undermining myself as an artist. I would never do that. And for what anyway...a few nothces up the ladder? Hm. No.</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Interesting. It kinda looks like a photo of a picture though - maybe went too far on the processing?   Barely any destructive processing, actually. Just tweaked some delicate stuff and I did give it one texture. The hotel is unbelievable. Everyone, and I mean everyone gets lost here. Each turn of the corner is another look and feel of the hotel.And it would be very illegal for me to take a photo of a photo, wouldn''t it. Not to speak of undermining myself as an artist. I would never do that. And for what anyway...a few nothces up the ladder? Hm. No.', '2010-01-26 02:02:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5840687, 843309, 61084, '<td valign="top">It''s cool seeing your daughter when she was a newborn in the diapers and now when she is a bit older and a little girl. That''s one of the great benefits of belonging to the DPC community...it''s like family and you get to see all the children grow up over the years. Great family shot!</td>', 'It''s cool seeing your daughter when she was a newborn in the diapers and now when she is a bit older and a little girl. That''s one of the great benefits of belonging to the DPC community...it''s like family and you get to see all the children grow up over the years. Great family shot!', '2010-01-28 14:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5842923, 843246, 89341, '<td valign="top">I think for starters the best of is going to be the hardest to get a good score, lower scores are going to be handed out more. Technically, overall it looks a little soft and flat to me, did you sharpen it after resizing? I did a very quick and dirty edit ....<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=850548" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_850548.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_850548.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/89341/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_850548.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I think for starters the best of is going to be the hardest to get a good score, lower scores are going to be handed out more. Technically, overall it looks a little soft and flat to me, did you sharpen it after resizing? I did a very quick and dirty edit ....', '2010-01-29 09:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
